<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɔzh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɛza Iyeshi Iyi I Ngyi Mu Kwuwo Ungwu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="imt1">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛza Iyeshi iyi i ngyi mu kwuwo ungwu Ɔzhɔnu ɛlɛ, i zɔ Ɔzhizɔsi tee akwu Iso iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ &lt;&lt;i nvyindɔ onzu akwɛyi i ŋɔ mbala nzu.&gt;&gt; Kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo kwɔlɛ mafyingwu kwu so, Ɛza Iyeshi ɛlɛ o ka yi te kaa enzu umba o wa yi lo kwidu lo fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi tee uwu gba akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo le, Usama uwu bɔkɔ o siso wu o shimɛzhi awu, tee gba o kwidu o fulo mawu, o yi kwunyɔ (20.31). Mizhikembo iyi i zɔ tee Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu Iso iyi Ukpo le, akwɛyi kwɔkpo ungwu Ɛza Iyeshi ɛlɛ kwu zɔ apula iyi amɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi bɔkɔ i zɔ ndunduu tee Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu Usama, Umɛ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ o siso wu o shimɛzhi awu kego. Akwɛyi ɔ zɔ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ apula iyi amɛ ɛlɛ i wangyi kwudu. Kuko ungwu kwokpo kwɔlɛ kwu so ewo iyi bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o kwidu o fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi akwu wambwalu wu, umbafo ba o towu mo akwɛyi o nyama kaa lo kwidu lo fulo mawu mo. Ɛmɛ iyɛkwu 13-17 i zɔ iŋɔma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala wavɔngɔ kiya wu mutu uwu bɔkɔ o yiwu mo, mbala iso iyi bɔkɔ i ka mba ɛnwu ma iyi bɔkɔ e so mbo eyikpomo iyi kwɔfyi ungwu lukwu wu. Imbwama iyi kwokpo kwɔlɛ kwu siso meka iyi iyimo mbala ombwu uwoyi ingbɛma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, lukwu mbala iyimo mu kwuvɔ wu, ewo iyi a zɛ ɛnwu ma laa wavɔngɔ kiya wu mizhikembo iyi e yimo mu kwuvɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛza iyi oko uwu bɔkɔ o yi wu mo mu kaya itomo (8.1-11) o shi yi mɛmba kwuwongwu ikama iyi kwonze mbala iyi i mbwalu yi guruguru i kyo ɛza iyi oko ele mo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔzhɔnu e siso iyɛkɔkɔ mu meka iyi rɛshi ingyi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ ungwu kwu ngyi mbaa Okrasi, ungwu ye kekelele mu enzu umba o kwidu o fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi tee uwu gba akwu ɔgwuzɛ le, ongbulolo mbala kwunyɔ le. Kiya ingyi ki to egbo mo mu kwokpo ungwu Ɔzhɔnu kwɔlɛ gba akwu ewo iyi o wo ɛduma mu apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mate embyi, kwoburodi, ɛbɛ, upya ilɔ mbala ilɔ wu, uwɛyi uwu ovanyi mbala imuma wu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu iyemo (1.1-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima mbala wavɔngɔ kiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi umba kwonze (1.19-51)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ (2.1—12.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Afyi imbwambwa mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbala kɛlɛ mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ (13.1—19.42)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyimo mu kwuvɔ mbala izɛma iyi Ɔkwu laa enzu (20.1-31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso: Ɔkwu a gba a zɛ ɛnwu ma kpɔ mu Ogalili (21.1-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Iso Iyi I Shi Kwunyɔ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Mu iyemo Iso ɛlɛ iyi mɔmɔ; Iso ɛlɛ i yi mbala Ukpo, Iso ɛlɛ akwu Ukpo. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Iso ɛlɛ i yi mbala Ukpo ngbaa mu iyemo.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Akwu i zɛ mawu gba Ukpo e wo apula iyinayina le. Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o wo ngyi ba akwu mawu mo, ki yi mo. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Iso ɛlɛ gba akwu undu uwu kwunyɔ le, akwɛyi kwunyɔ kwɔlɛ kwu ka la enzu ɛbɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ɛbɛ ɛlɛ i lemo mu ipwu, ipwu ba i do yi inyima mo.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ukpo a lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ wu ma, onzu awu o ya wu te Ɔzhɔnu. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />E bo te kaa le so enzu iso iyi ɛbɛ ɛnyi, kaa enzu lɛɛbi lo pwa ɛlɔgbulɔ ɛlɛ kaa lo mbwalu. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Akwu Ɔzhɔnu mafyi wu gba akwu ɛbɛ ɛnyi le mo; uwu e bo te kaa le so enzu iso iyi ɛbɛ ɛnyi le. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu ɛbɛ shɛ le - ɛbɛ iyi bɔkɔ i lemo mu onzu uwunawuna i yi mu inyɔma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />E yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ungwu bɔkɔ mbala wu gba Ukpo e wo ngwu le, tetete enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ɔ zɔngɔma wu ma mo. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />E bo mu ɛzhi wu, enzu umba ɛzhi wu ba ɔ na wu mo. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Tetete, enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ na wu akwɛyi o mbwalu wu e shi mbo ekpasu kaa lɔ kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Umba o kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu inɔma iyi ɔnu mbala oko mo. Akwu onzu gba akwu ete mbo le mo. Ukpo mafyiwu gba akwu Ete mbo le.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Iso ɛlɛ i vindɔ onzu uwu bɔkɔ esheshi mbala ongbulolo i nyɔlɔ wu ma duduu akwɛyi a ŋɔ mbala nzu. Kinzu ki ma inzumbɛku wu, inzumbɛku iyi bɔkɔ a na kwuwongu akwu Umɛ Uwɛnyi uwu Ada.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Ɔzhɔnu e so iso mu reshi wu akwɛyi a ta anu te, &lt;&lt;Ele gba akwu onzu uwu mi za yi te, &lt;Onzu uwu e yi mu inyɔma mizhikembo mi awu a ka mi ma, moo e yi ngbaa mu iyemo dɛ gba o bo mba mi le.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Mu esheshi wu iyi bɔkɔ i yi gyɔɔ awu gba ki fya rɛshi ingyi apula ikikɔ ikikɔ le. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Moo ɛrama iyi Ukpo i zɛ mu kwuwo ungwu Omosisi, esheshi mbala ongbulolo ba i zɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Onzu uwunawuna a da ma Ukpo dɛ mo; Umɛ Ukpɛnyi uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mbala Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ akwu Ukpo awu gba a zɔ nzu Ukpo le.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɛgbulɔ Iyi Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Omatiyu 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Omaki 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Oluku 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Kwuye ngwu bɔkɔ Azhu umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o lɔ ebwoshi umba Ukpo mbala Olevi ma te lo so lo yo Ɔzhɔnu te uwu akwu uwe, <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ɔzhɔnu e nvye yi mbo mo mo. Uwu ba e so mbo gedegede te, &lt;&lt;Akwu Imi gba mi kwu Okrasi le mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Akwɛyi o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Ba ŋɔ kwu uwe? Ŋɔ kwu Elazha re?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ɔzhɔnu a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Mi kwu Elazha mo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">&lt;&lt;Nana uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu anukenzu uwu ki yi mu eyi wu ifulomo le ŋa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">A gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ayimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi akwɛyi ɔ mbwa o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Ba ŋɔ kwu uwe ŋa? So nzu nɛ kaa la ki gba la ki ka la umba bɔkɔ ɔ lɔ nzu. So nzu onzu uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ kwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a gba mba opwu mu iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu Azaya a ka te, &lt;&lt;Akwu Imi gba Azaya e so le te, uwu a pwa opwu uwu onzu mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara u ta anu te, &lt;la lu ngbɛ ɔgwuzɛ la Ɔkwu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Akwɛyi Afarisi umba bɔkɔ ɔ lɔ mba ma awu, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ zɔ te ŋɔ kwu Okrasi mo, ŋɔ kwu Elazha mo, ba ŋɔ kwu anukenzu awu mo, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔɔ wo obatisima?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Ɔzhɔnu ba a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Obatisima mi, mi wo mu embyi,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;onzu uwufo ba e yi meka yi mu nɛ uwu lu yi wu mo. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />U wu gba e yi mu inyɔma mizhikembo mi le, uwu bɔkɔ ekyikyi iyi ekpoyata wu lala mi do te mi vuvu yi ma mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo mu Ɔbɛtani mu ɛsɛnyi iyi ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu e yi mu obatisima iwomo awu.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Umɛ Uwu Ilɔ Uwu Ukpo Le.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a ma Ɔzhizɔsi te e yi mu inyɔma munyi wu akwɛyi a ta opwu kpaa te, &lt;&lt;la lu yese Ilɔ uwu Ukpo. Uwu gba akwuu ingbomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ ma lɛɛbi le! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />U wu gba mi so le kwuye ngwu bɔkɔ mi za yi te, &lt;Onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu inyɔma mu izhikembo mi awu a ka mi ma moo e yi dɛ gba o bo mba mi le.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mu iyemo, Imi mafyi mi lala mi zɔngɔma wu ma mo. Kelele mi zɔngɔma wu ma-a, gba mi bo mi wo enzu obatisima mu embyi kaa lɔ wa wu lɔ zɔ ɛmɛ umba Izirɛ kaa lo yi wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu e so iyi bɔkɔ e yitu tee: &lt;&lt;Mi ma Kwundu uwu Ukpo a wɔ moshi kyamate ogarikwokwo tayi akwɛyi e kwu mawu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Mu kwuye ngwɔlɛ lala, mi yitu wu mo kpɔ. Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi te la mi wo obatisima mu embyi awu gba a zɔ mi wu le te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu ŋɔ ma Kwundu uwu Ukpo a wɔ moshi e bo mɛzhi akwɛyi e kwu mawu, uwu gba akwu u wo enzu obatisima mu Kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri le.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Imi mi ma mu eyi mi gba mi gyite la mi so yi le te onzu ele gba akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Umba Kwonze Umba Ɔzhizɔsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Mu eyi i lama, Ɔzhɔnu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu wepo ɔ gba ɔ ka mu riyi ngyɛngyi kpɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Kwuye ngwu Ɔzhɔnu a ma Ɔzhizɔsi te e yi mu ikakama, akwɛyi a ta anu tee, &lt;&lt;la lu yese Ilɔ uwu Ukpo a kaawu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu wepo mbamba o pwa tayi, akwɛyi o le mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e gele eyi akwɛyi a ma mba te o ye wu mu imbwaluma, akwɛyi e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Lu gagyi kwuwongumbe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Akwɛyi o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Orabayi&gt;&gt; (iyi bɔkɔ iluma yi akwu, U zɔ kiya awu) &lt;&lt;muna bɔkɔ ŋɔ kpo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;la lu bo kaa lu ma mbaa bɔkɔ mi kpo&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Akwɛyi ɔ ka ɔ ma mbaa e kpo akwɛyi ɔ na mbala wu mɔmɔ. Kwuye ngwu bɔkɔ ɔ ka munyi wu awu ɔnu u bo-o.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Anduru, umanyiwu Ɔsamɔ Opita e yi mɛmi iyi enzu wepo umba bɔkɔ ɔ pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu e so akwɛyi o le mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma awu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Kiya ingyi kwonze ingyi bɔkɔ Anduru e wo gba akwu te a gagyi Ɔsamɔ umanyiwu dɛ, akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki ma Usama awu-o&gt;&gt; (uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Okrasi awu.) <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Akwɛyi Anduru e bo wu mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Ɔzhizɔsi a bɔ wu eyi shii akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Ɔsamɔ umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔnu le. O ya ŋa te Okefasi ŋa&gt;&gt; (iyi ɔ lunyi te Opita awu).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ya Ofilipu Ma Mbala Ɔnataniyɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ e sheye mu Ogalili akwɛyi a ma Ofilipu akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Ofilipu a wɔ mu kwuse ungwu Ɔbɛsayida kyaa mbala Anduru mbala Opita. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Ofilipu a ma Ɔnataniyɛ akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki fye onzu uwu bɔkɔ o ka iso wu mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi awu, uwu bɔkɔ anukenzu umba Ukpo tete ɔ ka iso meka wu awu, uwu o ya wu te Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti, umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔsɛfu awu-o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Akwɛyi Ɔnataniyɛ e yo tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔnazarɛti! Kiya ingyi esheshi ki do te ki wɔ mɔmɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Akwɛyi Ofilipu a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Bo kaa ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma Ɔnataniyɛ te e yi mu inyɔma munyi wu, akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ele gba akwu umɛ uwu Izirɛ shɛ le. Imwilo i yi mawu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Ɔnataniyɛ e yo Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ wo la bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi ma ŋa ngba kwuye ngwu ŋɔ yi mu undu uwu uwɛyi uwu oboriyo dɛ ishi Ofilipu a ya ŋa ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Akwɛyi Ɔnataniyɛ a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo le; uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Ɔsu uwu Izirɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ nyama la mi kwuwongu mi za ŋa te mi ma ŋa mu undu uwu uwɛyi uwu oboriyo le? Ŋɔ ma apula iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛlɛ ma memowu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ɔzhizɔsi e kyo a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo mɛɛ, lu ma oshi u wuma gboo akwɛyi lu ma alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo te o yama, o kalama mami, Umɛ uwu Onzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Odumudumu Uwu Oko Itomo Mu Ogalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwɔla, o wo odumudumu uwu oko itomo mu kwuse ungwu Okena mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili. Anyi wu Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mɔmɔ, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu, ɔ lɔ la mba tete mbaa odumudumu awu. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ embyi umba iwomo umba agboga o bomo, anyi wu Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Embyi umba iwomo mbo o bo-o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ, akwu ŋɔ gba ŋɔ so mi kiya ingyi mii wo le mo&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kwuye mi kwu du bo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Akwɛyi anyi wu Ɔzhizɔsi a za la enzu umba ɛduma te, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ A za yi te la lu wo, ba la lu wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ariba iyi embyi ɛrɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ o wo mu ekyi i yi mɔmɔ. Kworiba kwukpɛnyi kwu ri ɛgalɔ i pika uwo ekpepo ma. Ariba ɛlɛ o shi yi kwuwongu alɛ igbɔma iyi bɔkɔ ukwu uwu Azhu u zɔ te lo wo.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la enzu umba ɛduma mbamba te, &lt;&lt;la lu nyɔlɔ ariba a ɛlɛ ma mu embyi&gt;&gt;; akwɛyi o nyɔlɔ yi ma duduu!<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;la lu gyi ŋa nɛ kaa la lu ka la u to keyi uwu odumudumu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:8">Akwɛyi o gyi o ka wu, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />akwɛyi a pwa embyi mbɔlɛ ma umba bɔkɔ o vindɔ embyi umba inyima le. Uwu ba e yitu muna bɔkɔ embyi umba inyima mbɔlɛ o ngyi mo, enzu umba ɛduma mbamba gba o yitu le. Akwɛyi a ya ɔnu uwu okopo ma mɛmba <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt; Uwewe a da la embyi umba bɔkɔ o shoshi o ka le gba ee shi le. Mizhikembo iyi agboga o wo o do mbo mo-o gba aa wa la umba bɔkɔ o shoshi o ba mo le. Uŋɔ ba ŋɔ nvye umba bɔkɔ o shoshi o ka le mo nzhii ba kwuye ngwɔlɛ gba ŋɔ wa mba kwudu le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu kɛzɔ unga amɛ unga kwonze bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo mu kwuse ungwu Okena mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili le. Iwomo ɛlɛ i wa laa inzumbɛku iyi Ɔzhizɔsi kwudu, akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o kwu idu o fulo mawu.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ka Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12">Omatiyu 21.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Omaki 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Oluku 19.45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi mbala anyi wu mbala ɛmanyi wu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yi o ka mu Ɔkapanawu akwɛyi ɔ ŋɔ mɔmɔ afyi bwɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ka Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12">Omatiyu 21.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Omaki 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Oluku 19.45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Tabɔkɔ kwuyengwu odumudumu uwu ikalama uwu Azhu kwu ndafo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mu okpulo uwu Ɔtɛpu mɔmɔ e du enzu mu endo iyama mbala ilɔ mbala atatabiri, mbafo ba ɔ ŋɔma o yi mu eduwo ingangama la enzu mu eteburu. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi e wo kwukpa mu ekyikyi akwɛyi a ra mbama lɛɛbi ɔ wɔ kwudu mu ɔtɛpu mbala ilɔ mbala endo mbo; eduwo iyi wa nganga eduwo a kpa yashaa akwɛyi apula iyi iŋɔma mba e kpo ye mbwe mbwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Akwɛyi a kpa wa ya atatabiri ma ɛyi, a za mba te, &lt;&lt;la lu wa mba kwudu munɛ! Uwe a za yi te kwogba ungwu Adami akwu mbaa rishi iyama!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o lolo iyi bɔkɔ ɔ ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te, &lt;&lt;Idɛnyi iyi kwogba ŋa i pwu mi kyamate ɔyi tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Akwɛyi wa to keyi umba Azhu o ko yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Kɛzɔ unga amɛ unga na bɔkɔ ŋɔ zɔ nzu kaa li zɔ te ŋɔ yi idu mo iyi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi iwomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu a za mba te, &lt;&lt;la lu shiri ɔtɛpu ele mo nɛ, Imi ba mi gba wala imbomo mu afyi ɛla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Akwɛyi Azhu o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Lɔri uwekpendo la lɔrɛnyi gba o to gba o mbo ɔtɛpu ele le, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ zɔ te ŋɔ gbawa la imbomo mu afyi ɛla bi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ɔtɛpu uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so le ba akwu ɛnwu wu gba e so le. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Mizhikembo iyi o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo mu kwuvɔ akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o lolo iyi e so, akwɛyi ɔ nyama la iso iyi bɔkɔ ɔ ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo mbala iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Yitu Iyi Egbo Iyi Onzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbaa Odumudumu uwu ikalama, enzu gyɔɔ ɔ ma lɔzɔ undu amɛ undu e yi mu iwomo akwɛyi o nyama la wu. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a nyama la mba mo, moo e yitu mbo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Ugɔ a kpa wu kaa lo so wu iso iyi onzu mo, moo e yitu iyi egbo iyi enzu lɛɛbi.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Onikodimusu E Bo Mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Onzu uwu Ofarisi uwufo e yɔmɔ o ya wu te Ɔnikɔdimɔ, e kyo mu udaba uwu watekeyi umba Azhu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ɔnu uwufo e bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi mutu akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, kinzu ki yitu te ŋɔ kwu onzu uwakwu uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mba Ukpo. Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e yi mbala wu mo ba e wo apula iyi amɛ ɛlɛ, e yi mo.<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so ŋɔ le, te, onzu uwu o gba wa la imbama mo, a ma ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Akwɛyi Ɔnikɔdimɔ e yo wu te, &lt;&lt;I wo la bɔkɔ ɔ gba la onzu imbama?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;E do te e fye mu ubwu uwu anyi wu ungwopo kaa lɔ gba wa la imbama mo ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Mi so ŋɔ ongbulolo mɛɛ, gba onzu ɔ gba wa la imbama mu embyi mbala Kwundu mo, e fye mu ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo mo. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Onzu aa mba onzu, Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba gba e shi onzu kwundu le. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Li shi ŋɔ kenzu iyama kwuwongu mi za ŋa te, &lt;Mega ɔ gba yi la imbama&gt; mo. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Ŋɔ pwa kwokpo kwu to munamuna mbaa bɔkɔ kwu gyi, tetete ba ŋɔ yitu mbaa bɔkɔ kwu ngyi mo nana mbaa bɔkɔ kwu sheyi mo mo. Tatayi gba i yi le mbala onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba a mbawu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔnikɔdimɔ e yo Ɔzhizɔsi te, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ i wo la ba i womo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ kwu u zɔ kiya uwakuu mu ɛzhi iyi Izirɛ,&gt;&gt; gba ŋɔ zɔngɔma apula ɛlɛ ma mo le? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ongbulolo gba mi so ŋɔ le te, apula iyi bɔkɔ ki to izɔgɔ ma yi ele akwiyi bɔkɔ ki yitu yi ba ki ma yi. Tetete lunyi lu nyama la izɔgɔ nzu mo. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Mi so yi iso iyi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lala lunyi lu nyama la yi mo, lu wo la ba lu nyama, gba mi so yi iso iyi apula iyoshi? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Onzu uwunawuna a da ka moshi dɛ mo, Umɛ uwu Onzu, uwu bɔkɔ e ngyi moshi awu kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Kyamate bɔkɔ Omosisi a bɔ ɔkwu uwu kwoso mu kwuwɛyi mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara awu, tatayi gba ɔ bɔ Umɛ uwu Onzu mu kwuwɛyi le, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />te kaa onzu uwunawuna uwu akwu idu e fulo ma wu, le yi kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Moo Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ gyɔɔ akwɛyi e shi Umɛ wu ɛnyi te kaa onzu uwunawuna uwu akwu idu wu e fulo ma wu e kpɛdɔma mo, uwu ba aa fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Moo Ukpo a lɔ Umɛ wu mu kwudu kwɔlɛ te kaa la zɔ mba ombu uwoyi mo, akwu kwuwongu kaa kwudu kwɔlɛ lakwu fya isama ma wu. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwu idu lu fulo mawu, ɔ zɔ wu ombu uwoyi mo, ishi onzu uwunawuna uwu e kwu idu lu fulo ma wu mo, ba ɔ zɔ wu ombu uwoyi ee kwuwongu akwu idu lu fulo mu ɛnyi iyi Umɛ ɛnyi uwu Ukpo mo. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ombwu itomo gba u yi te: Ɛbɛ i bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, enzu ba o gyi ipwu o ka ɛbɛ ma kwuwongu apula iwomo mbo akwiyira. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo ira, a gyi ɛbɛ mo, u wu ba e bo mbaa ɛbɛ mo kwuwongu a riyi te ira wu i bi ta kwudu ndunduu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu e wo apula iyeshi ba e bo kɛlɛ mbaa ɛbɛ kaa enzu lo ma gedegede te Ukpo gba e shi mbo ekpasu iyi apula ɛnyi iwomo le.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izɔgɔ Iyi Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima Mu Reshi Ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu ɔ ka mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya. A ngbɛ kwuye bwɛɛ mbala mba mu enzu obatisima iwomo. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Kwuye kwɔngu, Ɔzhɔnu tete e yi mu enzu obatisima iwomo mu Ɛnɔ kɛlɛ mbala Osalimu kwuwongu embyi o yi mɔmɔ gyɔɔ. Enzu gyɔɔ o ka munyi wu kaa le wo mbo obatisima. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Ɛlɛ i wo dɛɛ gba o bo ta Ɔzhɔnu mu ugu ugyi le.) <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Akwɛyi kaambu ka ta la ɛmɛgba umba Ɔzhɔnu mbafo mbala onzu uwu Ozhu uwufo meka iyi ɛnwu igbɔma iyi i shi onzu a ŋɔ sɛsɛsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Akwɛyi ɛmɛgba umba Ɔzhɔnu mbamba ɔ ka mbaa wu, akwɛyi ɔ za wu te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, onzu awu uwu bɔkɔ a ri mbala ŋa mu ɛsɛnyi iyi ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda, uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi izɔgɔ mawu awu, a ŋɔ aawu mu enzu obatisima iwomo, enzu lɛɛbi o yi mu ikama munyi wu kaa le wo mbo obatisima.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi onzu a fya, akwu Ukpo gba e shi wu le. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Lunyi mafyi yi lu kwu azɔgɔ mi, moo mi so kpeke te, &lt;Akwu Imi gba mi kwu Okrasi le mo, ɔ lɔ mi ilɔma kaa la mi to wu keyi le bi.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mu odumudumu uwu oko itomo, okopo akwu uwu onumboko. Umɛza uwu ɔnu uwu okopo ba a rima kaa la pwa opwu wu akwɛyi ɔnyɛ wu a nyɔlɔma duduu tabɔkɔ a pwa opwu uwu ɔnu uwu okopo awu.Tatayi gba ɔnyɛ mi a nyɔlɔma le kekelele. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Mega, inzumbɛku wu i kyomo, iyami ba i gyima.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onzu Uwu A Wɔ Moshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ moshi a ka onzu uwunawuna ma; onzu uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ba akwu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ, iso wu ba akwiyi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ. Uwu, uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ moshi a kaa uwewe mo. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />E so iyi bɔkɔ a ma ba a pwa moshi, tetete onzu uwunawuna a nyama la iso wu mo. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu a na iso wu de ba a nyama te iso iyi Ukpo akwu ongbulolo. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔ wu ele, iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so wu le gba e so le, kwuwongu Ukpo e shi wu ekpasu iyi Kwundu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Edego-ala e pwu idɛnyi iyi Umɛ wu, kwuwo ngɔlɛ a lafya la ingyinangyina mu ewo wu. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ akwu idu lu fulo mu Umɛ uwu Ukpo, a fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔ ma, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e towo Umɛ uwu Ukpo mo ba a fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔ ma mo, moo amba umba Ukpo o yi mu reshi wu iyɔkpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Okokpayi Uwufo Uwu Osamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔ te akwɛyi a pwa te Afarisi o pwa yi e te uwu e yi mu enzu ifyama e wo mbo obatisima a ka Ɔzhɔnu ma, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />ba akwu Ɔzhizɔsi mafyi wu gba e yi mu enzu obatisima iwomo le mo, Wavɔngɔkiya wu gba o yi mu iwomo le. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa tayi, akwɛyi a lafya la ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya akwɛyi a gba a ka mu Ogalili.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Uwu ba a kwa wu ɛga kaa la zɛ mu Osamariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Akwɛyi e bo mu kwuse ungwu o ya ngwu te Osika mu Osamariya, ungwu kwu yi kɛlɛ mbala kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhɛkɔpu e shi umɛ wu, Ɔzhɔsɛfu awu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Obuga uwu Ɔzhɛkɔpu e yi mu kizɛ ngyɛngyi. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔma mɔmɔ kwuwongu ɛnwu ikwumo iyi luzɛ. Akwu mu ɔnɔnda gba ɛlɛ i wo le.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Akwɛyi okokpayi uwu Osamariya uwufo e bo mbaa embyi igyima mu obuga awu. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Shɔɔkɔ shi mi embyi kaa la mi wo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu ba o yi mɔmɔ mo, o ka mu kwuse kaa lɔ ya kiya ingyirimo.) <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Akwɛyi oko uwu Osamariya awu a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Ozhu, Imi ba mi kwu oko uwu Osamariya. Ŋɔ wo la ŋɔ nda mi embyi kaa wo?&gt;&gt; (Moo Azhu mbala enzu umba Osamariya o nyama la esu mo.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Gba la ŋɔ yitu iyi rɛshi ingyi Ukpo mbala onzu uwu a nda ŋa embyi ele, ba ŋɔ bi nda wu akwɛyi e shi ŋɔ embyi umba o shi kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Akwɛyi oko awu e yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, ŋɔ yi kiya ingyi embyi igyima mo, ɔbuga ele ba e ndomo. Muna bɔkɔ ŋɔ fya embyi mbɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ o shi kwunyɔ le? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Naa ŋɔ ka ete nzu Ɔzhɛkɔpu ma ŋa, uwu bɔkɔ a vanzu ɔbuga ele akwɛyi uwu mafyi wu e wo embyi wu mbala ɛmɛ wu mbala luzhi wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo embyi mbɔlɛ, ugbembyi u wo wu mo kpɔ, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo embyi umba bɔkɔ mi shi wu ba ugbembyi u wo wu mo fo. Embyi umba mi shi wu oo yi kyamate kwubwu ungwu embyi mu ɛnwu wu tayi ungwu bɔkɔ kwu kpomo mo, kwu tembyi iyɔkpɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o shi wu kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Akwɛyi oko awu a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, shɔɔkɔ shi mi embyi mbɔlɛ nɛ kaa ugbembyi lu wo mi mo fo akwɛyi mi nyɔ mbaa embyi igyima munɛ fo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;So kaa ngye la ɔnu ŋɔ kaa la lu bo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Oko awu a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Mi yi ɔnu mo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Iyi ŋɔ so le akwu ongbulolo. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ongbulolo gba e yi te, ŋɔ ya anu walɔ ɔ, onzu uwu ŋɔ yi mbala wu kekelele lala akwu ɔnu ŋɔ mo. Iyi ŋɔ so kekelele tegba i yi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Akwɛyi oko awu a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba,&gt;&gt; Mi ma mate ŋɔ kwu anukenzu tayi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Umbetenzu ɔ lɛ Ukpo mu lɔwa ndɔlɛ, lunyi Azhu ba lu zɔ te mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ gba ifate lɔ lɛ Ukpo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ, nyama la iso mi, kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma memowu bɔkɔ enzu ɔɔ lɛ Ukpo mu lɔwa ndɔlɛ mo ba ɔ lɛ wu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Lunyi enzu umba Osamariya lu lɛ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu yitu ngyi mo; kinzu ba ki lɛ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki yitu ngyi, moo isama i ngyi mba Azhu. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Tetete kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma, kekelele lakwu bo-o bɔkɔ enzu umba o gbo Ukpo oya ngboro ogbo wu mu kwundu mbala ongbulolo, moo enzu wa gbo Ukpo oya mbɔlɛ te gba Ukpo a gagyi le. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ukpo akwu kwundu, enzu wa gbo wu oya ba mega o lɛ wu mu kwundu mbala ongbulolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Oko awu a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Mi yitu te Omezaya&gt;&gt; (uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Okrasi awu) &lt;&lt;e yi mu inyɔma. kwuyengwu e bo, a zɔ nzu kiya iŋyyinangyina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Imi uwu mi yi mu iso isomo mbala ŋa le gba mi kwu Okrasi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Mu kwotota kwɔngu akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ngyi o du wu mu iso isomo mbala oko ele akwɛyi i shi mbo kenzu iyama te e yi mu iso isomo mbala okokpayi. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ ee yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔɔ gagyi mbe&gt;&gt; naa &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ŋɔ siso mbala wu?&gt;&gt; ba e yi mo.<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Akwɛyi oko ele a lafya la uta uwembyi wu, a gba a ka mu kwuse akwɛyi a za la enzu te, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt;la lu bo kaa lu ma onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so mi apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ mi wo dɛ-ɛ. Naa ele gba akwu Okrasi le ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Enzu o wɔ kwudu mu kwuse akwɛyi o ka munyi wu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Kwuye kwɔngu ba Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ye wu mu isomo te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ri kiya nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />U wu ba a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Mi yi kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ mi ri ingyi bɔkɔ lu yitu ngyi mo ndii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o le mu esu isomo te, &lt;&lt;Naa onzu uwufo a ka wu la kiya ingyi irimo-o ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyirimo mi,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;akwu i wo kiya ngyi onzu uwu a lɔ mi ma awu, kaa la mi mbwa ɛduma wu iwomo. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Lunyi lu yi kwoba te, &lt;I shi evya endo ka lo lɔ ewiri.&gt; Imi ba mi so yi te la lu yese itu marimari; ewiri i mbo mo-o, i do ilɔma-a. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Kekelele lala u lɔ ewiri e yi mu rigbɛ wu inama-a, e yi mu ewiri ɛlu ikpalama iyi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ kaa u somo mbala u lɔma lɔ mwɔnyɛ kyaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kwoba ungwu kwu zɔ te, &lt;Onzu ukpɛnyi e somo uwufo ba a lɔma&gt; kwu so ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Mi lɔ yi ka la lu lɔ ewiri mu utu uwu bɔkɔ lu wo ɛduma mo. Enzu umbafo gba u wo ɛduma mɔmɔ le, akwɛyi lu ri kwule ungwu ɛduma mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Enzu umba Osamariya gyɔɔ mu kwuse kwɔngwu ɔ mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi kwuwongu oko awu e so mbo te, &lt;&lt;E so mi apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ mi wo dɛ-ɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kwuye ungwu enzu umba Osamariya o bo munyi wu, o kpa wu ɛshɛku te la ŋɔ mbala mba, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔ mbala mɔmɔ afyi epo. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Kwuwongwu iso wu, enzu gyɔɔ kpɔ o mbwalu wu,<verse eid="JHN 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Akwɛyi o za la oko awu te, &lt;&lt;Kekelele ki mbwalu ŋa, akwu kwuwongu iso iyi ŋɔ so le mo, akwu kwuwongu ki pwa wu mafyi nzu, kekelele ki yitu te u wu gba akwu Usama ngboro uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Umɔnzɔnu Uwu Onzu uwakwu Uwufo Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Mizhikembo iyi e wo afyi epo mɔmɔ, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo a ka mu Ogalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Moo uwu mafyi wu a so kpeke te, &lt;&lt;Anukenzu e yi umwɔ mu ɛzhi wu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />kwuyengwu e fye mu Ogalili, enzu umba mɔmɔ o na wu ewo epo, kwuwongu o ma apula iyi bɔkɔ e wo lɛɛbi kwuyengwu o ka mbaa Odumudumu uwu Ikalama mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ awu.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a ka mu Okena mu Ogalili, mbaa bɔkɔ a vindɔ embyi umbidɔ o kwu embyi umba imuma iyi oboriyo awu. Onzu uwu ɛduma iyi ogominɛti e yi mɔmɔ uwu bɔkɔ umɛ wu, ɔnzɔnu a nɔ mu ɛzhi iyi ofya mu Okapanawu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Tabɔkɔ onzu ele a pwa te Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ mu Ozhudiya e bo mu Ogalili, akwɛyi a ka munyi wu akwɛyi a kpa wu ɛshɛku te le so mu Okapanawu kaa le bo umɛ wu, uwu bɔkɔ a nda la lukwu fo awu ofya ma.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Gba lunyi lu ma lɔzɔ undu amɛ mbala apula iyi izele mo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;lu nyama mo ndii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />U wo ɛduma iyi ogominɛti awu a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, bo mi nɛ moo umɛ mi e kpomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Sheyimo iyaŋa, umɔnzɔnu ŋɔ ee yi kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Onzu ele a nyama la iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi a ka ma kyawu. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu luzɛ e sheye mogba, akwɛyi ɛmɛgba wu o kpolo wu akwɛyi o za wu te umɛ wu e yi mu ekpasu ifyama. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />E yo mbo iyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ umɛ wu a fya okpara uwu ɛnwu ma, akwɛyi o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Akwu mule mu ɔnɔnda gba okpaki a lu wu afyima le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Akwɛyi ada uwu umɛ awu e lolo te akwu mu kwuye kwɔngu pwa gba Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ ŋɔ e yi kwunyɔ&gt;&gt; le. Akwɛyi uwu mbala agba wu lɛɛbi o kwidu o fulo.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu kɛzɔ unga amɛ ungopo le unga bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo mizhikembo iyi a lafya la Ozhudiya a ka mu Ogalili.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Ukpokapiya Ofya Ma Mu Kenzu Unga Kwubwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbaa odumudumu uwu Azhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Kwubu kwu yi mɔmɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kɛlɛ mbala Kenzugu unga Ilɔ, ungwu o ya ngwu mu kenzu unga Iburu te Ɔbɛtisada ungwu bɔkɔ ekepe ɛlɔ i fula ngwu ma awu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Munɛ gba enzu umba efya gyɔɔ kyamate, epeyi, mbala enzu umba kinyɛ mbala wa kpokapiya, o koko o nɔ, o rigbo te kwubu kwɔngu lakwu wo akpa. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Mu kwuye, ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo ee bo akwɛyi e fo kwubu kwɔngu ma. Onzu uwu ofya uwu bɔkɔ e tekeyi la ifyemo kwuyengwu embyi umba kwubu kwɔngu o wo akpa, ofya umbunambuna umbwu e yi mbwu u bo mo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Onzu uwufo e yi mɔmɔ uwu bɔkɔ ofya wu u to lɔri uwekpela la lɔranda-a. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma wu te a nɔma mɔmɔ akwɛyi e yitu te ofya umbu onzu ele, u to kwuye gyɔ-ɔ, akwɛyi e yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ gyi te ofya ŋa lu bomo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Onzu uwu ofya awu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mi yi onzu munɛ uwu bɔkɔ aa mbwami ma kaa le to mi le lo mu kwubu kwuyengwu embyi o wo akpa mo. Kwuye ngwu mi yi mu ikyikyimo kaa la mi fyemo, akwɛyi onzu uwufo e to keyi la mi e fyemo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Yimo! To ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma ka zɛma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Mɔmɔ ofya umbwu onzu awu u bomo; e to ɔkyɔ wu akwɛyi e le mu luzɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Kwɔfyi ungwu bɔkɔ kiya ngyɛlɛ ki wo le akwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungwu Azhu, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ watekeyi umba Azhu o za la onzu uwu o bo wu ofya ma awu te, &lt;&lt;Ɔnɛ akwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo; ɛrama i nyama te to ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />U wu ba a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e bo mi ofya ma le a za mi te,&lt;To ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma kaa zɛma.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Akwɛyi o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a za ŋa te wo ɛlɛ awu akwu uwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Onzu uwu o bo wu ofya ma le ba e yitu uwe bɔkɔ akwu Ɔzhizɔsi mo, moo Ɔzhizɔsi a zɛ mekeka iyi riba ingyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ akwɛyi a wirima a kama iyawu .<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi e du wu mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Yese, kekelele ŋɔ gba la okpara uwu ɛnwu ŋɔ ma-a, lafya la ingbomo moo kiya ingyi ki ka ngyɛlɛ ma ki bi du ŋɔ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Akwɛyi onzu awu a ka ma akwɛyi a ka za la watekeyi umba Azhu te akwu Ɔzhizɔsi gba e bo wu ofya ma le.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, wa to keyi umba Azhu o le mu Ɔzhizɔsi inyashi ilomo kwuwongu e yi mu apula ɛlɛ iwomo mu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Adami e yi mu ɛduma iwomo nzhii ba kwɔfyi ungwu ɔnɛ, Imi tete, mi wo ɛduma mɛga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ wa to keyi umba Azhu o yirimo mu ɔgwuzɛ igagyima kaa lɔ ngbɛ wu ma; akwu kwuwongu bɔkɔ e fo ɛrama iyi Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo kɛɛkyi le mo, ikyo a zɔ te Ukpo akwu Ete wu, iyi bɔkɔ i zɔ te e fulo ɛnwu wu kyakya mbala Ukpo.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idomo Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, Umɛ Uwu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo mɛɛ, Umɛ e do kiya kinyinyi iwomo mafyi wu mo; iyi bɔkɔ a ma Ete wu te e yi mu iwomo, gba u wu ba e wo le. Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ada ee wo, Umɛ ee wo tete. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Moo Ada e pwu idɛnyi iyi Umɛ gba a zɔ wu iyinayina bɔkɔ e yi mu iwomo le. Ee, u wu lala a gba a zɔ wu apula iwomo iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛlɛ ma akwɛyi i shi yi lɛɛbi kenzu iyama. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kyamate bɔkɔ Ada ee yi enzu umba o kpomo mu kwuvɔ akwɛyi ee shi mbo kwunyɔ awu, tatayi gba Umɛ ee shi onzu uwu bɔkɔ uwu a gyi, kwunyɔ le. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ada ee to onzu ukpukpɛnyi te ombu mafyi wu mo. E shi Umɛ wu ekpasu lɛɛbi kaa le to ombu, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kaa uwewe le lo Umɛ ma kyamate o lo Ada ma tayi. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e lo Umɛ ma mo, e lo Ada uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ wu ma mo.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />&lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso mi akwɛyi e kwu idu lu fulo mu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi, e yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ombu uwoyi fo; a sa lukwu ma e yi kwunyɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Mi so yi ongbulolo mɛɛ, kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma, ungwu lakwu bo-o, bɔkɔ ɛkpɛzhi umba enzu ɔɔ pwa opwu uwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o pwa wu o gba lakwunyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Moo kyamate bɔkɔ Ada mafyi wu gba akwu undu uwu kwunyɔ le awu, tatayi e shi Umɛ kaa lakwu undu uwu kwunyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Akwɛyi e shi Umɛ ekpasu kaa le to ombu kwuwongu u wu akwu Umɛ uwu Onzu.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ li shi yi kenzu iyama mo, moo kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma bɔkɔ umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwuvɔ o pwa opwu wu <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />akwɛyi ɔ wɔ kwudu mu agariwu mba: umba bɔkɔ o wo iyeshi oo yimo oo yi kwunyɔ, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o wo iyira ba oo yimo akwɛyi o ngbɛ mba ombu uwoyi.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azɔgɔ Umba Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Imi mi do te mi wo kiya kinyinyi mu ekpasu mi mo; ewo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so mi gba mi to ombu le, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ombu itomo mi akwu ongbulolo kwuwongu akwu kiya ingyi mi gyi gba mi yi mu iwomo le mo, ingyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma a gyi gba mii wo le.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Gba mi zɔ izɔgɔ iyi ɛmi, izɔgɔ mi ɛnyi akwu ongbulolo mo. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Onzu uwufo ba e yi uwu bɔkɔ aa zɔ izɔgɔ iyami, Imi mi yitu te izɔgɔ wu mu reshi mi akwu ongbulolo.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />&lt;&lt;Lunyi lu lɔ alɔgbulɔ mbaa Ɔzhɔnu akwɛyi uwu ba e so ongbulolo. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Akwu te mii na izɔgɔ iyi onzu uwu inyi igyi le mo; Imi ba mi so ɛlɛ te ka la lu fya isama le. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Ɔzhɔnu e yi kyamate ututula tayi, e shi ɛbɛ akwɛyi lu nyama lu mwɔnyɛ iyi ɛbɛ wu kwuye bwɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi yi izɔgɔ iyami mu reshi mi iyi bɔkɔ i ka iyi Ɔzhɔnu a zɔ mu reshi mi ma. Ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Ada e shi mi te la mi wo, iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu iwomo, i zɔ tee Ada gba a lɔ mi ma le. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Ada uwu bɔkɔ a lɔmi ma le uwu mafyi wu a zɔ izɔgɔ mu reshi mi tete. Lu du pwa opwu wu dɛ mo ba lu du ma ureyi wu dɛ mo, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />iso wu ba i yi mu egbo yi mo, moo lu kwu idu fulo mu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ awu mo. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Lu shi egbo yi mu iso iyi Ukpo iwama marimari kwuwongu lu mamate tee ma yi gba lu fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔ le. Iso iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ gba ba i siso mu reshi mi le, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />tetete lunyi lu towo i bo munyi mi kaa la lu fya kwunyɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi yi mu kwupwɔ igagyima mbaa enzu mo. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Imi mi yitu yi, mi yitu tee lunyi lu yi idɛnyi iyi Ukpo mu egbo yi mo. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Imi mi bo mu idomo iyi Ada mi, lunyi ba lu na mi mo; gba onzu uwufo ba e bo mu idomo iyawu, lu na wu. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Lu wo la ba lu nyama la mi, moo lu gyi ipwɔma iyi esu ba lu wo ekpasu kaa la lu yi ipwɔma iyi bɔkɔ ii wɔ mbaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ u wu kɛɛkyi gba akwu Ukpo le mo awu?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />&lt;&lt;Lunyi ba la lu mate mi lo ewa yi mbaa Ada mo. Onzu uwu e lo ewa yi gba akwu Omosisi le, uwu bɔkɔ lu fulo eyi ma wu awu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Gba la lu nyama la Omosisi ngboro, ba la lu bu nyama la mi, moo a ka ɛzu mu reshi mi. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ɔbulɛ lunyi ba lu nyama la apula iyi bɔkɔ a ka mo le, lu wo la bɔkɔ lu nyama la apula iyi bɔkɔ mi so?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Shi Enzu Edubu Ɛlɔ Kiya Ingyi Irimo O ri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Omatiyu 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Omaki 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Oluku 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi a sa risu (ingyi Ogalili ma, ingyi gba akwu risu ingyi Otaberiya le), <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />akwɛyi enzu riba o mbwalu wu kwuwongu o ma lɔzɔ undu amɛ undu bɔkɔ e wo la enzu umba ofya. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mu lɔwa a ŋɔma mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Odumudumu uwu ikalama uwu Azhu ba a ndama fo.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma enzu riba te o yi mu inyɔma ma munyi wu, akwɛyi a za la Ofilipu te, &lt;&lt;Ki ya kiya ingyirimo muna bɔkɔ kii shi enzu mbɔlɛ kaa lo ri?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />E so ɛlɛ kaa la pwa wu ma le bi moo uwu e yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ee wo. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Ofilipu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyi irimo ingyi edinari ederi epo lala ki domo kaa uwewe la fya bwɛbwɛ mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Anduru, umanyi uwu Ɔsamɔ Opita, uvɔngɔkiya wu uwufo a to opwu tee, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Umɔnzɔnu uwufo munɛ e yi eburedi ɛlɔ mbala emu wepo munɛ, ɛlɛ kɔ i do kimbe mo mu riba ngyɛlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Ɔsɛ u yi gyɔɔ mɔmɔ, Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu shi enzu mbɔlɛ lo ŋɔma mɛzhi.&gt;&gt; akwɛyi anzɔnu mate edubu ɛlɔ te o ŋɔma. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi e to eburedi ɛlɛ ma, akwɛyi a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi a ka ngwu ma la enzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ ŋɔma mɔmɔ, i kyo emu tete. Uwewe a fya mate egbo wu i gyi.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Tabɔkɔ o ri bɔkɔ ubu e do mbo mo, Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu kpala ebwebwede iyi bɔkɔ i shimo awu ɛlu kaa lo fu mbo mo mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Akwɛyi o kpala ebwebwede iyi eburedi iyi bɔkɔ enzu mbamba o ri o shimo awu ɛlu, i nyɔlɔ lubiri luwo la lopo ma. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Mizhikembo iyi enzu mbamba o ma lɔzɔ undu amɛ undu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo, akwɛyi o le mu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Ele gba akwu Anukenzu uwu bɔkɔ a nyɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le kego.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu tee o gyi te lo to wu ɛsu mega, akwɛyi a gbama a ka mu lɔwa kɛɛkyi wu.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɛma Mu Kadu Unga Embyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Omatiyu 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Omaki 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Tabɔkɔ ɔnu u gbomo awu, Wavɔngɔkiya wu o solofo o ka mu kenzu unga risu, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />moo o fye mu kwoda mɔmɔ o sama o ka mu Ɔkapanawu. Ɔzhizɔsi e de bo mo, utu ba u kpomo-o. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Akwɛyi kwokpo ungwɔku kwu yimo akwɛyi embyi o wo agba. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o pɛ kwoda mate ata ederi ɛrɛnyi mbala erewo te, akwɛyi o ma Ɔzhizɔsi te e yi mu luzɛ mu kadu unga embi a gba mbaa kwoda; akwɛyi iyi i wo mbo mo. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za mba tee, &lt;&lt; Akwu imi; la lu riyi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Akwɛyi o nyama kaa le fye mu kwoda, akwɛyi kwoda kwu kpama mɛzhi mbaa bɔkɔ o sheyimo awu kɛlɛlɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu o Gagyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Mu eyi i lama, riba ingyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛsɛnyi iyi risu awu, o ma te kwoda kwunyi gba kwu yi mɔmɔ le, Ɔzhizɔsi ba e fye mangwu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya mo, Wavɔngɔkiya wu gba o kama kɛɛkyi mba le. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Akwɛyi ada iyi embyi iyifo i wɔ mu Otaberiya i bo i kpama mɛzhi mu kenzu unga embi kɛlɛ mbala mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e shi enzu kiya ingyirimo e ri awu mizhikembo iyi a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Tabɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu mbamba o ma tee Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yi mɔmɔ fo a wu,o fye mu kwoda o ka mu Okapanawu mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi ikagyima.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Kwoburodi Ungwu Kwu Shi Kwunyɔ Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ enzu o ka o du wu mu ɛsɛnyi iyi risu, o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ŋɔ bo munɛ kwuye ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo tee, akwu kwuwongu bɔkɔ lu ma apula iyi amɛ mbala lɔzɔ gba lu ye mi mu igagyima le mo, akwu kwuwongu bɔkɔ lu ri kiya ingyirimo bɔkɔ ubu e do yi mo le. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />La lu wo ɛduma kwuwongu kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki tutumo le mo, la lu wo ɛduma kwuwongu kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ kii shi onzu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ, Imi Umɛ uwu Onzu gba mii shi yi le. Moo Imi gba Ukpo Ada e shi mi ekpasu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Akwɛyi enzu mbamba o yo Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ki wo te bɔkɔ kii wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛduma iyi Ukpo akwu tee: la lu kwu idu lu fulo mu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔ wu e bo awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Akwɛyi enzu mbamba o yo Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Kɛzɔ ungana bɔkɔ ŋɔ zɔ nzu dɛɛ kaa la ki nyama la ŋa? Kimbe bɔkɔ ŋɔɔ wo? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />O ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee, umba asɔkwu nzu o ri omana mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara uwɛwuru &lt;Ukpo e shi mbo kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki wɔ moshi awu o ri.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;La mi so yi ongbulolo tee, akwu Omosisi gba a shi yi kiya ingyirimo gba lu ri le mo, Ada mi gba ee shi yi kiya ingyirimo ingyi ki wɔ moshi ngboro le. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ moshi e bo le gba akwu kiya ingyirimo ungyi Ukpo le, uwu gba ba ee shi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ kwunyɔ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Enzu mbamba o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ina mɔnɛ i sheye keyi koko ka shi nzu kiya ingyirimo ngyɛlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi kwu kiya ingyirimo ingyi kii shi kwunyɔ le. Enzu uwu bɔkɔ e bo munyi mi lonzu lu ngbɛ wu ma mo, enzu umba bɔkɔ e fulo idu ma mi ugbembi u wo wu wu ma mo. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Lunyi ba lu ma mi, ba lu nyama la mi mo. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ Ada e shi mi lɛɛbi ɔ nyɔ munyi mi, Imi ba mii na onzu uwu bɔkɔ e bo munyi mi, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />moo mi wɔ moshi mi bo le akwu te kaa la mi wo iyi egbo mi i gyi bi mo, akwu te kaa la mi wo iyi onzu uwu a lɔ mi. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Egbo iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi e bo le gba akwu tee, enzu umba bɔkɔ e shi mi lɛɛbi awu ukpɛnyi te le tomo mo, kaa la mi yi mbo mo mu kwuvɔ ɔnuwu imbwama. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Moo egbo iyi Ada mi i yi tee, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a bɔ eyi mu Umɛ awu bɔkɔ e fulo idu ma wu aa fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ, Imi ba mii yi wu mo ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu imbwama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Tabɔkɔ e so ɛlɛ, enzu umba azhu o le mu anu izɔma, kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt; Imi gba mi kwu kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki wɔ moshi ki bo mɛzhi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Akwɛyi o kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu Ɔzhizɔsi umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔsɛfu, uwu bɔkɔ ki yitu iyi ete wu mbala anyi wu le mo re? I wo te bɔkɔ a zɔ tee, &lt;Imi mi wɔ moshi&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu lafyima la anu izɔma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />&lt;&lt;Gba akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ada uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi awu a pya wu e bo munyi mi mo; i yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a nyɔ munyi mi mo, Imi ba mii yi wu mo ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu imbwama. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Anukenzu o ka yi ma tee: &lt;Ukpo a zɔ mba lɛɛbi.&gt; Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e shi alu mbaa Ada akwɛyi a vɔngɔ mbaa wu a nyɔ munyi mi. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ma Ada dɛɛ e yi mo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ngyi mbaa Ukpo awu kɛɛkyi; uwu kɛɛkyi gba a ma Ada dɛɛ le. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Imi mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e kwu idu fulo e yi kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Imi gba mi kwu kiya ingyirimo ingyi kwunyɔ le. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Umba ete yi o ri omana mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara tetete o kpomo. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki wɔ moshi awu ba ki ŋɔ le, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ri ngyi e kpomo mo. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Imi gba mi kwu kiya ingyirimo ingyi kwunyɔ ingyi ri wɔ moshi. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ri kiya ingyirimo ngyɛngyi, ee yi kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔ. Kiya ingyirimo ngyɛngyi gba akwu ɛnwu mi iyi bɔkɔ mii shi yi kaa enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lo yi kwunyɔ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Akwɛyi enzu umba Azhu o le mu kaambu ungakwuu irimo mbala esu tee, i wo te bɔkɔ onzu ele e shi nzu ɛnwu wu kaa la ki kwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo: onzu gba e kwu ivye iyi ɛnwu mi Umɛ uwu Onzu akwɛyi e wo ɛnzhi mi mo, e yi kwunyɔ mo. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwu ɛnwu mi ba e wo ɛnzhi mi mo e yi kwunyɔ, akwɛyi mii yi wu mo ɔnu wu imbwama. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Moo ɛnwu mi gba akwu kiya ingyirimo ngboro le ɛnzhi mi gba ba o gbo yi ugbembi mo ngboro le. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwu ɛnwu mi ba e wo ɛnzhi mi a ŋɔ mɛmi mi, Imi ba mii ŋɔ mɛmi wu. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Mate Ada uwu bɔkɔ e yi la reyi a lɔ mi ma ba mi yi reyi kwuwo wu awu, tatayi gba onzu uwu bɔkɔ e kwu ɛnwu mi ee yi kwunyɔ kwuwo mi le. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Imi gba mi kwu kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki wɔ moshi le. Umbasɔku yi o ri omana ba o kpomo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e ri kiya ingyirimo ngyɛlɛ e yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Ɔzhizɔsi e so ɛlɛ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ e yi mu enzu kiya i zɔma mu ugu uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu Okapanawu awu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iso Iyi Kwunyɔ Ungwɔkpɔ Ba Ɔkpɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Tabɔkɔ wambwalu wu gyɔɔ o pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt; Ɛzɔ ɛlɛ i kɔma. Uwe e do te a na yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu tee wabwalu wu o yi anu izɔma kwuwongu ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;ɛzu ɛlɛ ii shi yi luu gba kembo re? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Gba lu bu ma Umɛ uwu Onzu te a ya kadu a ka mbaa bɔkɔ e yi dɛ le kɔ? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba ee shi kwunyɔ le; ɛnwu ba i do kiya kinyinyi i womo mo. Iso iyi mi so yi ele akwu Kwundu ba akwu kwunyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />umbafo yi ba o kwidu fulo mami mo.&gt;&gt; (Moo Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu kpeke onzu uwu bɔkɔ e kwu idu lu fulo mo bɔkɔ e be to wu a ya ma.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ɔzhizɔsi e siso e kyo tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongu ɛlɛ gba mi so yi le tee, akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ada e shi wu ekpasu mo a nyɔ munyi mi ego mo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Wabwalu Ɔzhizɔsi gyɔɔ o lu o gbama akwɛyi i na mu kwuye kwɔngu o mbwalu wu fo. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la wepo mbamba tee, &lt;&lt;lunyi kɔ luu fulomo tete re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Ɔsamɔ Opita a gba wu pwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu ki re mba we? Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ yi iso iyi kwunyɔ ngwɔkpɔɔ le. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Ki kwu idu fulo tee uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Ɔkɛrikɛri uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mbaa Ukpo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu Imi gba mi ŋa yi lunyi wewo la wepo le mo re? Tetete onzu ukpɛnyi meka yi akwu onzu uwoyi! <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />(E so awu akwu meka iyi Ozhudasi umɛ uwu Ɔsamɔ Isikariyɔ, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ukpɛnyi meka iyi wewo la wepo mbamba, uwu gba e be to Ɔzhizɔsi a ya ma le.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Ɛmanyi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi a fulama mu Ogalili, a gyi te la gɔ mu Ozhudiya mo kwuwongu wa to keyi umba Azhu umba mɔmɔ o gyi te lo ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ odumudumu uwu ɛnu uwu Azhu ba e bo kɛlɛɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />akwɛyi ɛmanyi umba Ɔzhizɔsi o za wu tee, &lt;Lafya la munɛ kaa so mu Ozhudiya, kaa wa mbwalu ŋɔ lo ma ɛduma iyi amɛ iyi ŋɔ yi mu womo le. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a gyi te enzu lo yitu wu e wo kiya mu invyemo mo. Bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mu ɛlɛ i womo le, zɔ ɛŋɔ ma la enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lo ma ŋa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />(Moo ɛmanyi wu lala o nyama la wu mo.)<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye mi kwu du bo mo; lunyi kwuye ngunanguna akwu kwuye yi. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Enzu umba kwudu o wo anya yi mo, Imi ba o wo anya mi kwuwongu bɔkɔ mi so mbo tee ɛduma mba a kwuyira. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Lunyi la lu sheyimo mbaa odumudumu. Imi mi re mbaa odumudumu awu mo, kwuwongu kwuye mi kwu du bo mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Tabɔkɔ e so ɛlɛ akwɛyi a ŋɔ ya wu mu Ogalili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ka Mbaa Odumudumu Uwu Akapwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ɔbulɛ, mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ ɛmanyi wu o kama mbaa Odumudumu awu, uwu a kama tete, a zɛ gedegede mo, a zɛ wɛrɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Mbaa Odumudumu mɔmɔ, wa to keyi umba Azhu o gagyi Ɔzhizɔsi o yo kwuyo tee, onzu awu e yi muna?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Enzu o ga la iso wu gyɔɔ meka iyi enzu umba riba mɔmɔ, umbafo o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu onzu uwoshoshi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Umbafo ba o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ayimo, e kyoro enzu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Onzu ukpɛnyɛnyi te ba e siso wu gedegede mo kwuwongu oo wiyi iyi Azhu. Ɛnu<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o wo odumudumu o ka mu andanda, Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mu Ɔtɛpu akwɛyi e le mbo mu kiya izɔma. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Watokeyi umba Azhu o ya kenzu gyɔɔ o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;I wote bɔkɔ onzu ele e yitu iyi kiya gyɔɔ te le ba a vɔngɔ ɛzu mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Apula iyi bɔkɔ mi zɔ le akwu iya mi mo. I wɔ mbaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a gyi tee le wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi, a zɔngɔma yi ma nana kiya ingyi mi zɔ le ki ngyi mbaa Ukpo nana akwu iya mi. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e siso iyi afyi wu e so kwuwongu kaa la fya inzumbɛku la ɛwu, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma kwuwongu inzumbɛku iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ wu ma gba akwu onzu ongbulolo le; iso wu i yi imulo mo. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Akwu Omosisi gba e shi iyi ɛrama le mo re? Onzu ukpɛnyɛnyi yi te lala a mbwalu wu mo. Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu gyi te la lu ngbɛ mi ma le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Enzu umba riba mbamba o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ yi eyombeyi, uwe bɔkɔ a gyi te la ngbɛ ŋɔ ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mi wo kiya ingyi amɛ kikpɛnyi akwɛyi lunyi lɛɛbi lu ya kenzu. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Omosisi e shi kaza te la zɛ ɛmɛ yi anzɔnu ɛsɔ ma, (Ɛrama ɛnyi lala i ngyi mbaa Omosisi mo, i ngyi mbaa umbasɔku keyi), ba lu zɛ umɛ ɔnzɔnu ɛsɔ ma mu kwɔfi ungu ɛnwu igbomo ungwu Azhu. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Akwiyi gba lu zɛ umɛ ɛsɔ ma mu kwɔfi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo kaa ɛrama iyi Omosisi li fomo mo, kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ luu wamba mbala mi kwuwongu bɔkɔ mi bo onzu ofya ma mu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />La lu ma kiya meyi kaa la lu zɔ ombu byi mo, la lu zɔ ombu mu ototo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Omezaya Le?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Akwɛyi enzu umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ umbafo o yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ o gyi te lo ngbɛ wu ma le gba a ŋɔ le mo re? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Yese, a ŋɔ mu iso isomo gedegede le, ba o so wu kinyinyi te mo. Nana enzu umbakɔ nzu o nyama tee uwu gba akwu Okrasi lee ŋa? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kinzu ba ki yitu mbaa bɔkɔ onzu ele a wɔ; kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a ba nyɔ, ɔnzɛnzɛnyi te e yi mbaa bɔkɔ a wɔ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e degbo mu kiya izɔma mu Ɔtɛpu bɛnɛ, akwɛyi a ya opwu mo tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu yitu mi, ba lu yi mbaa bɔkɔ mi wɔ? Imi mi bo lɛmi mo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le akwu onzu ongbulolo. Lunyi ba lu yitu wu mo, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Imi ba mi yitu wu kwuwongu mi wɔ munyi wu uwu gba a lɔ mi ma le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Kwuwongwɔlɛ o gyi te lo yi wu mo, onzu ukpukpɛnyi te ba apwu wu afyi mo, kwuwongu bɔkɔ kwuye wu kwu du bo mo. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Tetete, enzu gyɔɔ mu riba ingyi enzu mbamba o kwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi. O zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Gba Okrasi awu e bo ee wo lɔzɔ undu amɛ aa ka ele moo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa To keyi Umba Azhu O Lɔ Asozha Ma Tee Lo Yi Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Afarisi o pwa tee enzu gyɔɔ o yi mu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi i somo kyokyo. Akwɛyi wa to keyi umba ebwoshi mbala Afarisi o lɔ wa gbo Ɔtɛpu mo tee lo so kaa lo yi wu mo.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt; Imi mii yi mbala yi kwuye bwɛ bi akwɛyi ba mii gbama mi re mbaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Luu kagyi mi, ba lu fya mi ma mo; mbaa bɔkɔ Imi mi yi, ba lu do te lu nyɔ mɔmɔ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Enzu umba Azhu o za la esu tee, &lt;&lt;Muna bɔkɔ onzu ele a gyi te le so bɔkɔ ki ma wu mo le? A gyi te le so mbaa enzu nzu umba bɔkɔ o kpashaa mekeka iyi Agiriki le kaa la zɔ Agiriki kiya re? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />A zɔ te ki kagyi wu ba ki ma wu mo, mbaa bɔkɔ e ri ele ba ki ba mɔmɔ mo. Iluma yi akwu mbɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Embyi Umba O Shi Kwunyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mu kwɔfyi ungwu imbwama ungwu bɔkɔ kwu kwuu ka le mu odumudumu awu, Ɔzhizɔsi yimo e siso mu opwu u wɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ ugbembi u wo wu mo le bo munyi mi kaa le wo. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwu idu lu fulo ma mi, mate kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo kwu so awu, embyi umba o shi kwunyɔ o tumo ma wu akwɛyi o rima.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi e so ɛlɛ mu reshi ngyi kwundu, Uwu bɔkɔ enzu wambalu o bo na awu. Kwuye kwɔngu o do shi kwudu o mo, kwuwongu Ukpo e de shi Ɔzhizɔsi inzumbɛku aa mo bɛnɛ, moo Kwundu Uwu Ukpo e bo mo.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu O Ka Epo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Tabɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛlɛ, umbafo mbo o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu Anukenzu kego.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Umbafo ba o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Uwu gba akwu Okrasi le.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Umbafo tete o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;I wo te bɔkɔ Okrasi aa wɔ mu Ogalili? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so mo re te Okrasi aa wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Odevidi mu kwuse ungwu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ mbaa bɔkɔ Odevidi a ŋɔ le mo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ enzu mbamba o ka epo kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Umbafo o gyi te lo yi wu mo, ba ɔzɛnzɛnyi te a pwa wu afyi ego mo.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa To keyi Umba Azhu O Kwidufulo Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Kwuye ungwu wa gbomo umba ɔtɛpu o gba o ka mbaa wa to keyi umba ebwoshi mbala Afarisi, o yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu yi wu mo mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wa gbomo mbamba o gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt; Ɔzɛnzɛnyi te e siso tayi dɛ mo,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Afarisi o yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;E kyoro yi moo tete re?.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />&lt;&lt; Luma utokeyi naa Afarisi ɛnyi tee e kwu idu fulo ma wu re? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Riba ngyi enzu mbɔlɛ o yitu iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo, kenzu itama ke yi mbo moo,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ɔnikɔdimɔ uwu bɔkɔ akwu onzu ɛnyi meka mba bɔkɔ a ka mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi dɛɛ awu, e yo kwuyo tee, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Ɛrama nzu ii shi onzu ombu uwoyi dɛ gba o bo pwa iyi bɔkɔ e wo le re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ wɔ mu Ogalili tete re? Yese kwokpo ungwu Ukpo, ba ŋɔ ma tee anukenzu ukpɛnyi te a da wɔ mu Ogalili dɛɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Oko Uwu Bɔkɔ O Yi wu Mo Mu Kaya Itomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a ka mu lɔwa ungwu Olifu <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Mu eyifumo a gba e bo mu okpulo uwu ɔtɛpu, enzu lɛɛbi o kpala ɛlu munyi wu, akwɛyi a ŋɔma ba e le mbo mu kiya i zɔma. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala Afarisi o yi okokpayi ɛnyi ma mu kaya itomo akwɛyi o bo wu. O shi wu a rima mu keyi, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />akwɛyi o za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, o yi oko ele mo mu kaya itomo. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Omosisi a ta nzu okpa mu ɛrama tee, mbɔlɛ te lo kpa mba ekyi. Kekelele ŋɔ zɔ te? <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />O yo wu kwuyo kwɔlɛ kaa lo kpa wu kwoda kaa lo yi wu mo. Ɔzhizɔsi ba e lemo akwɛyi a rala ɛfyi wu a ka ɛzu mɛzhi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Tabɔkɔ o le wo mu eyo i yomo, e yimo fa akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ingbomo mo, la kpa wu kwokyi keyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Akwɛyi e lemo a ka ɛzu mɛzhi kpɔ.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Tabɔkɔ o pwa ɛlɛ o fulomo kɛnyi kɛnyi ina mu onzu uwakɔ keyi, nzhii ba i shi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala oko awu kɛɛkyi a rima mɔmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo fa a rima akwɛyi e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt; Okokpayi, o yi muna? Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ngbɛ ŋɔ ombu uwu o yi meka mba mo re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Oko ele a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, ɔnzɛnzɛnyi te mo. Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee. &lt;&lt;Imi tete mi ngbɛ ŋɔ ombu uwoyi mo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Sheyimo iyaŋa ki ngbomo fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Ɛbɛ Iyi Kwudu Kwɔlɛ Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Kwuye ungu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a gba e siso mbala enzu, a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi kwu ɛbɛ iyi kwudu le. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a mbwalu mi a zɛma mu ipu mo, ba ee yi ɛbɛ iyi kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Afarisi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔɔ zɔ izɔgɔ la ɛŋɔ le; izɔgɔ ŋɔ akwu ongbulolo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Gba mi zɔ izɔgɔ la ɛmi lala, izɔgɔ mi akwu ongbulolo, moo mi yi mbaa mi wɔ ba mi yi mba mi sheyimo. Lunyi ba lu yi mba mi wɔ mo ba lu yi mba mi sheyimo mo. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Lu ra la amasa iyi onzu gba lu zɔ ombu le; Imi ba mi zɔ ombu uwu onzu uwunawuna mo. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Gba ba mi zɔ ombu lala, mi zɔ ongbulolo, moo mi yi kɛɛkyi mi mo. Mi yi mbala Ada, uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />O ka yi ma mu ɛrama yi tee, izɔgɔ iyi enzu wepo akwu ongbulolo. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Imi mi zɔ izɔgɔ laa ɛmi; Ada mi uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le, akwu uzɔgɔ mi uwufo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Akwɛyi o yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ada ŋa e yi muna?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lu yitu mi naa Ada mi mo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Gba la lu yitu mi, lubu yitu iyi Ada mi tete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Ɔzhizɔsi e so iso ɛlɛ kwuye ungu bɔkɔ e yi mu kiya izɔma mu ɔtɛpu kɛlɛ mba bɔkɔ o ta rɛshi awu. Ɔnzɛnzɛnyi te ba e yu wu mo mo, kwuwongu kwuye wu kwu du bo mo.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lu Do Tee Lu Ri Mbaa Bɔkɔ Mi Sheye Le Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a za mba kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi sheyimo, ba luu kagyi mi ba lu kpomo mu ingbomo yi. Mbaa mi sheyimo le, lu do te lu nyɔ mɔmɔ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ɛlɛ i shi Azhu o yo kwuyo tee,&lt;&lt;A ngbɛ ɛwu ma re? Bɔkɔ e so tee, &lt;&lt;Mbaa bɔkɔ mi sheyimo le, lu do te lu nyɔ mɔmɔ mo le&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lu kwu umba ɛzhi munɛ; Imi ba mi wɔ moshi. Lu kwu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ; imi ba mi kwu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Mi za yi te lu kpomo mu ingbomo yi; gba lu fulo idu tee Imi gba mi ŋɔ le mo, lu kpomo yi kego.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />O yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ Ŋɔ kwu uwe?&gt;&gt; Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Tabɔkɔ mi so yi mu iyomo awu te gba mi yi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Mi yi apula gyɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ mii ra yi mi ngbɛ yi ombu uwoyi. Ada uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le ba akwu ongbulolo, ba iyi bɔkɔ mi pwa munyi wu gba mi so kwudu kwɔlɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />O zɔngɔma yi ma tee, iso iyi Ada gba Ɔzhizɔsi e ye mbo mu isomo le mo. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ lu yi Umɛ uwu Onzu mo faa, akwɛyi lu yitu tee Imi gba mi ŋɔ le ba mi wo ingyi mi ma bi mo, kyamate Ada a zɔ mi awu gba mii wo le. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Ada uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le e yi mbala mi; a lu mi afyima kɛɛkyi mo, moo mi koko mi wo iyi bɔkɔ uwu a gyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu iso ɛlɛ isomo awu, enzu gyɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso ɛlɛ o fulo idu ma wu.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ongbulolo Gba A Wala Onzu Mo Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za la umba bɔkɔ o fulo idu ma wu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba lu ra la ɛzɔ mi, de ba lu kwu Wavɔngɔkiya mi kego. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Akwɛyi lu yitu iyi ongbulolo, ongbulolo awu ba aa wa yi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kinzu ki kwu eye umba Aburamu ba ki di gbo rinye la ɔnzɛnzɛnyi dɛɛ mo. I wo te bɔkɔ ŋɔ zɔ te, kii wɔma mu rinye le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e koko ee ngbomo akwu unye uwu ingbomo. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Unye e yi kizɛ ingyi i ŋɔma ngbɛɛ mu kwogba mo, umɛ ba akwu uwu kwogba iyi ɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Akwiyi gba umɛ a wa yi ma, de ba lu wɔma kego. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Mi yitu te lu kwu eye umba Aburamu. Ɔbulɛ ŋa lu gyi te la lu ngbɛ mi ma, kwuwongu lu towo ɛzɔ mi ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Imi mi so iyi bɔkɔ mi ma mbaa Ada mi, lunyi ba lu wo iyi bɔkɔ lu pwa mbaa ete yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />O gba opwu tee,&lt;&lt;Aburamu gba akwu ete nzu le.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">&lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba la lu kwu ɛmɛ mba Aburamu.&gt;&gt; ba lu bu wo iyi bɔkɔ Aburamu ewo awu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Kekelele lu gyi te la lu ngbɛ mi ma, iyi bɔkɔ mi so yi le ba akwu ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ mi pwa mbaa Ukpo. Aburamu ba e wo ɛlɛ te mo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Kiya ingyi ete yi e koko wo gba lu yi mu i womo le.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">O gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kinzu ki kwu ɛmɛ umba kaya mo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ukpo kɛɛkyi gba akwu ete nzu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo gba lakwu ete yi, lu bu pwu idɛnyi mi, moo mi wɔ mba ada gba mi ŋɔ le. Imi ba mi bo la ɛmi mo; uwu gba a lɔ mi le. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu zɔngɔma iso mi ma mo le? Kwuwongu bɔkɔ lu nyama te la lu ngbɛ alu mu iso mi mo le. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Lu kwu ɛmɛ umba ete yi onzu uwoyi, gba lu gyi te la lu wo ɛduma iyi ete yi a gyi le. Uwu akwu u ngbɛ onzu ngbaa mu iyemo, e yi ongbulolo mo, kwuwongu ongbulolo e yi ma wu mo. kwuye ungu bɔkɔ a mulo, ɛduma wu gba e yi mu iwomo le, moo akwu u mulo ngbaa mu iyemo. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Imi ba kwuwongu bɔkɔ mi so yi ongbulolo le, gba lu nyama la mi mo le! <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Uwe meka yi bɔkɔ e do te aa zɔ tee mi yi ingbomo? Akwiyi bɔkɔ mi so yi ongbulolo le, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu kwu idu lu fulo ma mi mo? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwu Ukpo a pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so. Lunyi kwu umba Ukpo mo gba lu pwa iyi Ukpo mo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Aburamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Azhu o gba Ɔzhizɔsi opwu tee,&lt;&lt;Ki so kya lo bɔkɔ ki zɔ tee ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu Osamariya ba ŋɔ yi eyombeyi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, Imi mi yi iyo uwoyi mo, Mi lo Ada mi ma lunyi ba lu lo mi mo mo. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Imi mi gyi inzumbɛku laa ɛmi mo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gya mi yi e yɔmɔ, uwu gba ba e to mi ombu le. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu uwunauwuna uwu bɔkɔ a ra la iso mi aa ma lukwu gbee mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Azhu o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;kekelele gba ki yitu tee ŋɔ yi eyombeyi le! Aburamu e kpomo la Anukenzu o kpomo uŋɔ ba ŋɔ zɔ tee, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a na iso mi e kpomo mo. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Uŋɔ ŋɔ ka ete nzu Aburamu ma re? Uwu loo, la Anukenzu loo o kpomo. Uŋɔ ŋɔ ma ɛŋɔ tee ŋɔ kwu uwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba mi shi ɛmi inzumbɛku, inzumbɛku mi ɛnyi akwu kiya mo. Ada mi, uwu bɔkɔ lu ya wu tee Ukpo yi awu, uwu gba e shi mi inzumbɛku le. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Lunyi lala lu yitu wu mo, Imi mi yitu wu. Gba mi zɔ te mi yitu wu mo, mi bi kwu u mulo kyamate lunyi te, Mi yitu wu ba mii mbwalu iso wu. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ete yi Aburamu a mu ɔnyɛ kaa la ma kwɔfyi ungu ibomo mi; a mangwu akwɛyi a mu ɔnyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Azhu o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ ba lɔri uwɛkpɛlɔ mo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ ma Aburamu oo le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, ongbulolo gba mi so yi le &lt;&lt;Mi yɔmɔ keyi dɛɛ, gba o mba Aburamu le,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Akwɛyi o kwu ekyi kaa lo kpa wu, Ɔzhizɔsi ba e nvyemo akwɛyi e wirima e shi ɔtɛpu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwu Bɔkɔ O Mba Wu La Ipeyi Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Wu Ofya ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu luzɛ e sheyimo, a ma onzu ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ o mba wu laa ipeyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, uwe bɔkɔ e ngbomo, uwu nana umba bɔkɔ o mba wu le ŋa, bɔkɔ o mba wu upeyi awu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Laa uwu laa enzu wu o ngbomo mo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ i wo te kaa Ukpo la zɔ ekpasu wu ma wu. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Akwu mɛga kaa la ki wo ɛduma iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le, tabɔkɔ ki yi mu ononda le. moo utu uu kpomo, akwɛyi ɔzɛnzɛnyi e do te e wo ɛduma fo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Tabɔkɔ mi yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le, Imi gba mi kwu ɛbɛ iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo, akwɛyi e fu ɔtɛ mɛzhi, a za ɔtɔtɔ ma, akwɛyi e nzo onzu ele meyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;So kaa vye eyi ŋɔ mo mu kwubu ungwu Osilo&gt;&gt; (iluma yi gba akwu tee ilɔma). Akwɛyi onzu awu a ka e vye eyi mo ba a gba e bo mogba la ɛbɛ imama.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Wa nɔ kpa wu mbala umba bɔkɔ o yitu wu la kwoya indama dɛɛ awu o yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e koko a ŋɔma bɔkɔ a nda kwoya awu gba a ŋɔ le mo re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Umbafo o zɔ tee akwu uwu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Umbafo ba o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ayimo a wɔ wu le bi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Uwu mafyi wu ba a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu Imi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Akwɛyi o yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;I wote bɔkɔ eyi ŋɔ i wuma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />A za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Ɔzhizɔsi awu a za ɔtɔtɔ akwɛyi e nzo mi wu meyi. A za mi tee so mu kwubu ngwu Osilo kaa vye eyi mo. Akwɛyi mi ka mi ki vye eyi mo, gba mi yi mu ɛbɛ imama ŋa le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />O yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu awu e yi muna?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">A za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mi yitu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afarisi O Vu undu Uwu Eyi Iwuma Iyi Upeyi Ele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Akwɛyi enzu o to onzu uwu bɔkɔ e peyi dɛɛ awu o ka wu la Afarisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kwɔfyi ungu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e nzo ɔtɔtɔ bɔkɔ e bo ofya umbwu onzu awu ma le akwu kwɔfyi ungu ɛnwu igbomo. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Akwɛyi Afarisi tete o yo onzu awu kwuyo kpɔ te ewo iyi na bɔkɔ a zɛ dɛɛ bɔkɔ a ma ɛbɛ. Onzu awu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;E nzo ɔtɔtɔ mu eyi mi&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Akwɛyi mi ka mi vye eyi mo, gba mi yi mu ɛbɛ imama ŋa le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Afarisi umbafo o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele a bɔ eyi mu Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo, a wɔ mbaa Ukpo mo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Umbafo ba o yo tee, &lt;&lt;I wote bɔkɔ onzu uwu ingbomo bɔkɔ ee wo ɛduma iyi amɛ ɛlɛ te?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o ka epo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Akwɛyi Afarisi o yo onzu ele kwuyo kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt; Uŋɔ gba a wu ŋɔ eyi mo le, ŋɔ zɔ te meka wu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Onzu awu a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu anukenzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Azhu o nyama tee onzu ele akwu upeyi dɛɛ gba a gba la ɛbɛ imama le mo, nzhii ba o ya enzu umba bɔkɔ o mba wu le ma dɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />O yo mbo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu umɛ yi uwu bɔkɔ lu zɔ te lu mba wu la ipeyi lee? I wo te bɔkɔ e yi mu ɛbɛ imama kekelele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o mba wu le o gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki yitu tee, akwu umɛ nzu, ba ki yitu te o mba wu la ipeyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ewo iyi bɔkɔ a ma ɛbɛ kekelele ŋa le ki yitu mo, naa onzu uwu bɔkɔ a wu wu eyi mo ki yitu mo, la lu yo wu kwuyo. Akwu umɛshɛri fo; A gba opwu mafyi wu ego!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Enzu wu o so ɛlɛ kwuwongu bɔkɔ o riyi iyi wa to keyi umba Azhu, moo Azhu o so kyaa te onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nyama te Ɔzhizɔsi akwu Okrasi o ra wu ma o shi ugu uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ɛlɛ gba i shi gba enzu umba bɔkɔ o mba wu le o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu umɛshɛri fo; la lu yo wu kwuyo le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />O gba la onzu uwu bɔkɔ e peyi dɛɛ awu la iyama akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;So nzu ongbulolo kwuwongu Ukpo! Mo ki yitu te onzu ele akwu onzu uwu ingbomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />A gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ta akwu onzu uwu ingbomo loo, ta akwu tayi mo, mi yitu mo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kiya ki kpɛnyi gba mi yitu le te. Mi kwu upeyi dɛ, kekelele mi ma ɛbɛ-ɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Akwɛyi o za wu tee,&lt;&lt;E wo ŋɔ te? E wo te bɔkɔ a wu ŋɔ eyi mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />A gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi za yi aa ba lu nya yi mo. Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu gyi te la lu pwa yi kpɔ le? Lu gyi te la lu kwu Wavɔngɔkiya wu, tete re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Akwɛyi wa to keyi umba Azhu o kpa wu ari tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu u vɔngɔ kiya uwu onzu awu le loo! Kinzu ba ki kwu Wavɔngɔkiya umba Omosisi! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Kinzu ki yitu tee Ukpo e siso mbala Omosisi, akwiyi onzu ele ba ki yi mbaa bɔkɔ a wɔ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Onzu awu a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ gba akwu kiya ingyi kenzu iyama le! Lu yi mba bɔkɔ a wɔ mo, ba a wu mi eyi mo. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ki yitu tee Ukpo a pwa enzu umba ingbomo mo. Aa pwa enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo iyi bɔkɔ a gyi. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ngbaa mekyeki ɔzɛnzɛnyi te a pwa te o wu eyi iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ o mba wu la ipeyi ma dɛɛ mo. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Gba onzu ele la wɔ mbaa Ukpo mo, e do tee e wo kiya kinyinyi te mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt; O mba ŋa mu ingbomo fɔrɔ; uŋɔ gba ŋɔ zɔ nzu le?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o ra wu ma.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipeyi Iyi Kwundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />kwuyengwu Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa tee o wa la onzu ele o ta kwudu, tabɔkɔ a ma wu, a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ fulo idu ma mi Umɛ uwu Onzu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Onzu awu e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, onzu awu akwu uwe?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Za mi kaa la mi kwu idu lu fulo mawu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ma wu aa; uwu gba e yi mu iso isomo mbala ŋa le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Akwɛyi onzu a wu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu mi kwu idu lu fulo,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi e kwumo e gbo wu ɔya.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu ombu izɔma gba mi bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le, kaa wa peyi lo ma ɛbɛ, wa ma ɛbɛ ba lo peyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Afarisi umbafo umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ o pwa te e so ɛlɛ akwɛyi o yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe le! Kinzu tete ki kwu wa peyi ŋa moo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Gba la lu peyi Ukpo a ba ngbɛ yi ombu uwoyi te lu kwu enzu umba ingbomo mo; kekelele ba lu zɔ te lu ma ɛbɛ, ingbomo yi i degbo bɛnɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu U gbo Ilɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ mu kenzugu unga ogeza kaa le fyemo mɛmi mo, gba a yama e fyemo mɛmi mu ɔgwuzɛ owa, akwu uwɛlɔ mbala u zɛ kpɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ mu kenzugwu gba akwu u gbo ilɔ le. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />U gbo kwuri ba a wawu kenzugwu ma, ilɔ ba o pwa opwu wu. A ya ilɔ ma mu ɛnyi mba akwɛyi a wa mba kwudu. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ a wa mba kwudu, akwɛyi e to mbo keyi, ba ilɔ wu o mbwalu wu kwuwongu o yitu iyi opwu wu. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Umba ba o mbwalu onzu awa mo; umba lala o renya iyamba kwuwongu o zɔngɔma opwu wu ma mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba kwɔlɛ ba o zɔngɔma gwu ma mo.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu U Gbo Ilɔ Uwoshoshi Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo Imi mi yi kyamate kenzugwu unga ilɔ te. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Umbafo umba bɔkɔ o bo keyi la mi lɛɛbi awu akwu awɛlɔ mbala wazɛkpɔ, ilɔ ba o pwa iyamba mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Imi mi yi kyamate kenzugwu te; Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ mami e fyemo o sa wu ma. E fyemo a wɔma ba a fya kiya ngyirimo. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Uwɛlɔ e bo tee kaa la wɛlɔ kaa la ngbɛ kaa gba le tutu kiya ma; Imi ba mi bo te kaa la mi shi yi kwunyɔ, kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te&lt;&lt;Imi gba mi kwu u gbo ilɔ shɛ le. U gbo ilɔ aa nyama ka le kpomo kwuwongu ilɔ wu. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Onzu u na rigbɛ ingyi ilɔ igbomo, akwu u gbo ilɔ mo ilɔ ba akwu umba wu mo, ishi gba a ma utumutu te e yi mu inyɔma, a lafya la ilɔ ba a renya ee shi ilɔ mbamba; akwɛyi utumutu e yi ilɔ ma akwɛyi a kpa mba shaa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Onzu awu a renya i ya wu kwuwongu o to wu iyi rigbɛ ba a bɔ eyi mu ilɔ mo.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />&lt;&lt;Imi gba mi kwu u gbo ilɔ shɛ le; Mi yitu iyi ilɔ mi ilɔ mi ba o yitu mi <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kyamate bɔkɔ Ada e yitu mi Imi ba mi yitu wu awu, gba mi nyama te kaa mi kpomo kwuwo ngwu ilɔ le. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />I yi ilɔ umbafo umba bɔkɔ akwu umba ogeza ele mo. Mi nya mba mɛga tete. Umba tete o pwa opwu mi, akwɛyi uzhi uwu ilɔ akwu ukpɛnyi, u gbo ilɔ ba akwu ukpɛnyi. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />&lt;&lt;Ada a gyi mi kwuwongu mi nyama mi to kwunyɔ mi mi tama, mii gba mi to ngwu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />I yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to mi kwunyɔ ma mo, Imi gba mi gyi le gba ba mi ta ngwu mɛzhi le. Imi mi domo iyi kaa la mi ta ngwu mɛzhi kaa la mi gba ngwa la itomo. Mi na ɔkpa ele mbaa Ada.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Azhu o kepo kwuwongu iso ɛlɛ kpɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Riba mba o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;E yi kwundu ungwura! E kporishi! Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu shi alu mbaa wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Umbafo ba o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ akwu iso iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi kwundu ungwura mo. I zɛ te bɔkɔ kwundu ungwura kwu shi ɛbɛ la enzu wapɛyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azhu O Towo Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Kwuye ungwu odumudumu uwu ɔtɛpu iwuma mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, kwuye kwɔngu akwu kwuyengwu okpakyi, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi mu Ɔtɛpu e yi mu igɔma mu okepe uwu ɔsɔlɔmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Azhu o lo wu kwukpo, o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Nzhii ba kwuyengwuna dɛɛ bɔkɔ ŋɔ bu gba nzu opwu? Akwu uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Okrasi le, ba za nzu pee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Mi za yi aa ba lu kwu idu lu fulo mo. Ɛduma iyi amɛ iyi mi wo mu ɛnyi iyi Ada mi awu akwu u uzɔgɔ mi; <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />ba lu kwu idu lu fulo mo kwuwongu bɔkɔ lu kwu ilɔ mi mo le. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ilɔ mi o pwa opwu mi; Mi yitu mbo, umba ba o mbwalu mi. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Imi mii shi mbo kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ, ba o tomo gbee mo; Ɔzɛnzɛnyi te e do mbo inama mu ɔwu mi mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Ada mi, uwu bɔkɔ e shi mi mbo le, a ka uwewe ma; Ɔzɛnzɛnyi te e do mbo inama mɔwu uwu Ada mi mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Imi mbala Ada mi ki kwu ukpɛnyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Akwɛyi Azhu o kwu ekyi kaa lo kpa wu kpɔ, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za mba tee, mi wo ɛduma iyi amɛ gyɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ imbulama bɔkɔ Ada e shi mi te la mi wo meyi yi, iyi na bɔkɔ lu kpa mi ekyi kwuwo yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Azhu o gba opwu te, ki kpa ŋa ekyi kwuwongu ɛduma iyeshi ikpikpɛnyi te mo, akwu kwuwongu ŋɔ pe Ukpo ari, moo uŋɔ onzu uwidɔ bi ŋɔ ya ɛŋɔ tee Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;O ka yi ma mu Ɛrama yi mo re tee, &lt;Ukpo a zɔ tee lu yi kyamate Ukpo.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔma la mba le gba o ya mba tee &lt;O yi kyamate Ukpo uwakɔ, iso iyi Ukpo ba i fomo mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Imi uwu bɔkɔ Ada a ŋa mi tee la mi kwu uwawu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le kɔ? I wo te bɔkɔ lu se mi eyi tee mi pe Ukpo ari kwuwongu bɔkɔ mi zɔ te, mi kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Akwiyi gba akwu ɛduma iyi Ada mi gba mi yi mu iwomo le mo, de ba la lu kwu idu lu fulo ma mi mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Akwiyi gba akwu inyi gba mi yi mu iwomo le, gba lu fulo idu ma mi mo lala, la lu fulo idu mu ɛduma iyi amɛ ɛnyi, kaa la lu yitu kaa gba la lu zɔngɔma yi ma tee, Ada e yi mɛmi mi Imi gba mi yi mɛmi iyi Ada.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />O gyi tee lo yi wu mo kpɔ, ba a wirima e shimbo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a sama a ka mu risu ingyi Ɔzhɔda mba bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu e koko e wo obatisima dɛ awu. Mɔmɔ gba a ka ŋɔ le <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />enzu riba ba o bo munyi wu. O zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhɔnu de ewo ɛduma iyi lɔzɔ ndu amɛ mo, iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu e so meka iyi onzu ele akwu ongbulolo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ba enzu ribariba o kwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi mɔmɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lukwu Undu Ɔlazarɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Onzu uwufo a pwofya o ya wu tee Ɔlazarɔ uwu kwuse ungwu Ɔbɛtani, kwuse ungwu Omeri mbala umanyiwu Omata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Omeri ele akwu uwu gba a ngbɛ Ɔkwu anyi umbu umbwɔ ferere mu alɛ akwɛyi a nwu yi ma mu inyi wu le, Ɔlazarɔ ele akwu umanyi uwu Omeri. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ɛmanyi wu eko mbɔlɛ o lɔ ɛlɔgbulɔ mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi tee lo za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, umeza uwu idu ŋɔ e yi mu ofya ipwama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imbwama iyi ofya mbwɔlɛ akwu lukwu undu Ɔlazarɔ mo; ɛlɛ i wo le kaa Ukpo la fya inzumbɛku le, akwɛyi aakwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ Umɛ uwu Ukpo aa fya inzumbɛku le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Ɔzhizɔsi e pwu idɛnyi iyi Omata mbala umanyi wu oko mbala Ɔlazarɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Tetete, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ a pwa te Ɔlazarɔ e yi mu ofya ipwuma, a ŋɔma mɔmɔ nzhii ba afyi epo kpɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Akwɛyi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu bo la ki gba la ki so mu Ozhudiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya ba o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;kuye bwɛ ele gba Azhu o gyi te lo to ŋɔ ekyi le, ŋɔ gba ŋɔ gyi te la ŋɔ so mɔmɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwɔfyi kwu yi awa uwolepo mo re? Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɛma mu ɔnɔnda a lɛfyi mo, moo a ma ɛbɛ iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Akwiyi gba o zɛma mutu gba o lɛfyi , kwuwongu o yi ɛbɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa ɛlɛ isomo, akwɛyi a gba a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛza nzu Ɔlazarɔ e kpondo, Imi ba mi ri mi bi nyi wu eyimo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o gba wu opwu tee, Ɔkwu, akwiyi gba e yi mu ondo ikpolomo, ofya wu uu bomo lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ɔzhizɔsi e ye mbo mu iso isomo meka iyi lukwu undu Ɔlazarɔ, umba ba o ma kyamate akwu iso iyi ondo ikpolomo bi.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo iso gedegede tee, Ɔlazarɔ e kpomo-o, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />kwuwo yi Imi mi mu ɔnyɛ te mi yi mɔmɔ mo, kaa la lu kwu idu lu fulo mami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Akwɛyi Otoma (uwu o ya wu tee apiri awu) a za la Wavɔngɔkiya umba o shimo awu tee, &lt;&lt;Kinzu la ki kyo la ki somo mbala wu tete, ka la ki kpomo mbala wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba E Yi Enzu Mo Mu Kwuvɔ Le; Gba Akwu Kwunyɔ Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e bomo, e du tee Ɔlazarɔ o kpa wu ami afyi endo-o.<verse eid="JHN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Indama iyi Ɔbɛtani mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ i yi mate emeli epo te, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Azhu umbafo ba o bo mbaa Omata mbala Omeri ka lo gbo mbo idu mo kwuwongu lukwu undu umanyi mba ɔnzɔnu. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Omata a pwa te, Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iŋyɔma, akwɛyi a ka te e kpolo wu, Omeri ba a ŋɔ iyawu mogba.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Akwɛyi Omata a za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, gba la ŋɔ yi munɛ, umɛnɛ mi e bo kpomo mo. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Tetete, Imi mi yitu tee kekelele lala Ukpo ee shi ŋɔ kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ nda wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛnɛ ŋɔ ɔnzɔnu aa gba e yimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Omata a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi yitu tee aa gba e yimo mu kwɔfyi ungwu imbwambwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mii gba lakwunyɔ mii shi enzu le, imi gba mi kwu kwunyɔ le. Onzu uwu e kwu idu lu fulo mami, gba e kpomo lala aa gba e yi kwunyɔ; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ luzɛ wu akwu undu ikwu idu lu fulo ba a nyama la mi ee kpomo gbee mo. Uŋɔ ŋɔ nyama mu iso mi ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Omata a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee, Ɔkwu, Imi mi nyama te uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Okrasi le, Umɛ uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu inyɔma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Loga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Tabɔkɔ a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo, akwɛyi a gba a kama a ka ya umanyi okokpayi Omeri ma mɛmba. A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya e yi munɛ, ba e yi mu kwuyo ŋɔ iyomo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Bɔkɔ Omeri a pwa ɛlɛ, e yimo kporo akwɛyi a ka bwa wu ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ɔzhizɔsi e de fye mu kusɛ kwɔngu mo bɛnɛ, e degbo mbaa bɔkɔ Omata a ke du wu awu. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Azhu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala Omeri mogba mu ɛyi ibyima o ma te e yimo efyefya a wɔ kwudu, akwɛyi o mbwalu wu, o ma te e sheye mu ogariwu mbaa oga ilomo mɔmɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Omeri a ka mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi, tabɔkɔ a ma wu akwɛyi e kwumo mu idu wu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, la ŋɔ yi munɛ, umɛnɛ ɔnzɔnu le bo kpomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma wu mu oga ilomo, mbala Azhu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala mba tete mu oga ilomo, akwɛyi e wo ubugyi mu kwundu akwɛyi a ma inyashi mba gyɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Lu kpa wu ami muna?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, bo kaa ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Ɔzhizɔsi e loga.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Akwɛyi Azhu o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi a gyi Ɔlazarɔ gyɔɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Umbafo mba ba o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu onzu ele gba a wu upeyi eyimo le mo re? Akwu mo ba le be shi Ɔlazarɔ le kpomo mo nɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Yi Ɔlazarɔ Ma Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba e wo ubugyi mu kwundu kpɔ, akwɛyi a ka mbaa Ogariwu. Ogariwu awu akwu kwofyo, akwɛyi o kpo kwoki ungufo mu kenzu ngwu. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu pya kwoki ma!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Akwɛyi Omata umanyi uwu Ɔlazarɔ, a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, onzu ele aa wumbwɔɔ, moo ɔnɛ akwu afyi endo bɔkɔ o kpa wu ami le-e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi za ŋa tee, akwiyi gba ŋɔ kwu idu lu fulo, ŋɔ ma inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo mo re?<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Akwɛyi o pya kwoki kwɔngu ma. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yi eyefa moshi akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, mi gbɛlɛ ŋɔ ɛnyi kwuwongu ŋɔ pwa mi. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Imi mi yitu tee kwuyengwunanguna ŋɔ yemi mu ipwama, Imi ba mi so ɛlɛ kwuwongu enzu umba o ri munɛ le, kaa umba lo kwu idu lu fulo tee uŋɔ gba ŋɔ lɔ mi le.<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Tabɔkɔ a mbwa ɛlɛ isomo, Ɔzhizɔsi e to opwu uwɔkwuu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔlazarɔ, wɔ kwudu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Akwɛyi onzu uwu e kpomo le a wɔ kwudu, ewo mbala alɛ wu o wu yi mo mu okpayi uwu ukpɛzhi mbala ureyi wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu vuvu ekpayi ɛnyi ma kaa le sheyimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Wo Okura Iyi O Ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Omatiyu 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Omaki 14.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Oluku 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Azhu gyɔɔ umba o bo gbɛlɛ Omeri ɛnyi, bɔkɔ o ma apula iyi amɛ iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo,akwɛyi o kwu idu fulo ma wu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Umbafo mba ba o ka mbaa Afarisi, ka lo ba mba eza iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala Afarisi o kpala ɛlu. O zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kii wo te? Onzu ele e yi mu apula iyi amɛ gyɔɔ iwomo. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Gba ki lu wu afyima , enzu lɛɛbi o kwu idu fulo ma wu, akwɛyi Asozha umba Oromu o nyɔ o shiri Ɔtɛpu nzu ma o kyo o ngbɛ ɛzhi nzu ɛdɔ ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Akwɛyi ukpɛnyi meka mba, o ya wu tee Okayafasi, uwu bɔkɔ akwu obwoshi uwakɔ mu kari kanga le, e yimo a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu yitu iyi kiya kikpikpɛnyi te mo ndii! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Lu fa la izɔngɔma te, i koshi kaa onzu ɛnyi le kpomo kwuwongu enzu, bɔkɔ ɛzhi lɛɛbi i bi kpɛdɔma awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Iso ɛlɛ e so mu ekpasu wu mo, ba kwuwongu bɔkɔ akwu obwoshi uwakɔ kari kanga le, gba e kwu epa tee Ɔzhizɔsi e kpomo kwuwongu ɛzhi iyi Azhu le, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />akwu kwuwo mbo kɛɛkyi mo, ba akwu kwuwongu kaa la kpala ɛmɛ umba Ukpo umba o kpashaa munamuna ɛlu, kaa lo kwu enzu wakpɛnyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, i na mɔnu mawu o wo ɔgwuzɛ uwu o ngbɛ wu ma.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Ɔzhizɔsi e koko a zɛma gedegede meka iyi Azhu fo, uwu ba a ka mu riyi ingyi bɔkɔ ki yi kɛlɛ mbala kwokata, mu kwuse ungwu bɔkɔ o ya ngwu tee Ifiremu. A ŋɔ mɔmɔ mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Kwuye ungwu odumudumu uwu ikalama uwu Azhu kwu ndafo, enzu riba o wɔ mu ese mbo o ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa lo wulu ɛmba ma dɛ kaa odumudumu uwu ikalama awu le bo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />O kwo mu Ɔzhizɔsi igagyima, o ri mu ɔtɛpu mu esu kwuyo iyomo tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu ma te? A ŋa nyɔ mbaa odumudumu ele mo ndii re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala Afarisi o ta ɔkpa tee, gba onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yitu mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi, le so mbo kaa lo yi wu mo.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">O La Ɔzhizɔsi Anyi Mu Kwuse Ungwu Ɔbɛtani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Omatiyu 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Omaki 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />I shi afyi ɛrɛnyi kaa odumudumu uwu ikalama le bo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e bo mu Ɔbɛtani kwuse ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔlazarɔ e yi, uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi wu mo lukwu awu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Enzu mba mɔmɔ o wo wu kiya ingyirimo ingyi onoyo, Omata gba akwu u ka enzu kiya ingyirimo le, Ɔlazarɔ ba e kyo mbala enzu umba o ŋɔma mbala Ɔzhizɔsi mbaa kiya irimo. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Akwɛyi Omeri e to ogya uwu anyi umba abwa umba Onadi, akwɛyi e lo mbo Ɔzhizɔsi mu alɛ, akwɛyi e nwu mba ma mu inyi wu. Akwɛyi kwogba lɛɛbi ngwu akwu umbwɔ ferere.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Akwɛyi ukpɛnyi meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu, Ozhuda Isikariyɔ - uwu bɔkɔ a ba ya kwoya wu awu - a zɔ tee, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />&lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ anyi mbɔlɛ o ya mba ma mu eduwo gyɔɔ kaa lo ra yi lo shi ayirewa mo ? I yi mate eduwo iyi oo shi onzu u wo ɛduma iyi kari tayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />E so iso ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongu a ma inyashi iyi ayirewa le mo, akwu kwuwongu akwu uwɛlɔ le; kwuwongu uwu gba akwu u ra la kakyɔ unga eduwo le, ba e koko aa mbwama lɛwu mu eduwo iyi bɔkɔ o ta ma nga awu. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lo shuwebi. E shi anyi mbɔlɛ rito e gbo kwɔfyi ungwu ami ikpama mi. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ayirewa o yi mbala yi iyɔkpɔɔ, imi ba mi yi mbala mi iyɔkpɔɔ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Wo Okura Iyi O Ngbɛ Ɔlazarɔ Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Azhu riba o pwa te Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu Ɔbɛtani, akwɛyi o ka mɔmɔ kaa lo ma wu mbala Ɔlazarɔ uwu bɔkɔ e yi wu mo mu lukwu awu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ebwoshi umbakɔ o ka amasa iyi o ngbɛ Ɔlazarɔ ma, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />moo kwuwo wu, Azhu riba o lu mba afyima akwɛyi o kwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi ŋa.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ Mate Ɔsu Tayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Omatiyu 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Omaki 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Oluku 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Mu eyi i lama, enzu riba ingyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo mbaa odumudumu uwu ikalama awu o pwa tee Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu inyɔma mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Akwɛyi o kwu epederi o ka o kpolo wu, o le mu opwu itarama tee, &lt;&lt;Osana!&gt;&gt; Esheshi akwiyi uwu bɔkɔ e ngyi mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu!&gt;&gt; Esheshi akwiyi Ɔsu uwu Izirɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />O ka la Ɔzhizɔsi ɔgbɛbɛ uwu Ɔzɛki akwɛyi a yama mawu, mate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo tee, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />Uŋɔ ki wiyi mo, kwuse ungwu Ɔzayɔ; Yese Ɔsu ŋɔ e yi mu inyɔma, mu ɔgbɛbɛ uwu Ɔzɛki .&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi o zɔngɔma ɛlɛ ma kwuye kwɔngu mo; kwuyengwu ba o shi wu inzumbɛku dɛ gba o zɔngɔma tee ɛlɛ o ka mu reshi wu le, ba o wo wu apula ɛlɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Enzu riba umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o yi Ɔlazarɔ ma mu Ogariwu awu, o koko o ba eza la enzu iyi bɔkɔ umba o ma le. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Akwɛyi enzu mbɔlɛ o ko bwa wu ma, kwuwongu o pwa apula iyi amɛ iyi bɔkɔ e wo le. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Akwɛyi Afarisi o za lesu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu ma, apula i zɛ ɔnyɛ la nzu mo. Lu ma, enzu lɛɛbi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ o ye wu mu imbwaluma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agiriki Umbafo O Yo Kwuyo Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Agiriki umbafo o yi meka iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ka te oo gbo Ukpo ɔya mu odumudumu awu. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />O ka mbaa Ofilipu uwu a wɔ mu kwuse ungwu Ɔbɛsayida mu Ogalili akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, ki gyi te la ki ma Ɔzhizɔsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Ofilipu a ka e ke so Anduru; Anduru mbala Ofilipu umba ba o ka o so Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye kwu wo-o ungwu bɔkɔ Umɛ uwu Onzu oo shi wu inzumbɛku. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Imi mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu ee so kwuyi ungwu owiti akwɛyi kwuu vama dɛ, akwu tayi mo ba kwu ri mu kwuyi kwukpɛnyi. Akwiyi gba kwu vama, kwu wa la eyi gyɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Onzu uwu a gyi kwunyɔ wu, kwuu tomo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e towo kwunyɔ wu ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kwuwo mi, ee shi ngwu rito kwuwongu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyi te le wo kiya shi mi, mega aa mbwalu mi, kaa umɛgba mi le yi mbala mi mbaa bɔkɔ mi yi. Adami ee shi onzu uwunawuna uwu e gbo mi rinye inzumbɛku.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Mɛka Iyi Lukwu Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Kekelele ubwu mi e fomo, ba mi so te? Mii zɔ tee, &lt;Ada, Ki nyama kaa kwuye kwɔlɛ la ku bo munyi mi mo&gt;? Ayimo, akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba mi bo le. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Ada, shi ɛnyi ŋɔ inzumbɛku!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Akwɛyi opwu u wɔ moshi u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi shi ɛnyi ŋɔ inzumbɛku-o, mii gba mii shi yi kpɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Enzu riba umba o ri mɔmɔ o pwa ɔlɛ, akwɛyi umbafo mbo o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo a kpɛyi; umbafo ba o zɔ tee ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e so wu iso.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />&lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, akwu kwuwo mi gba opwu ɔlɛ u wɔ le mo, akwu kwuwo yi. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Kekelele gba oo zɔ enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ombu le; kekelele ba ɔsu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ o ŋɔ kala wu ma mɛsu-o. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Akwɛyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o yi mi mo mu lukwu, mi nya la enzu lɛɛbi munyi mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />E so ɛlɛ le te kaa la zɔ lukwu undu bɔkɔ e be kpo.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Akwɛyi enzu riba mbamba o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛrama nzu i za nzu te Okrasi a ŋɔ nzhii ba iyɔkpɔɔ, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔ so te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwu Onzu oo yi wu mo mu lukwu mega? Uwe ba akwu Umɛ uwu onzu ele dɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛbɛ ii yi mbala yi kwuye bwɛ bɛnɛ. La lu kwo mu luzɛ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu degbo lu yi ɛbɛ le, kaa ipwu li bo li kpo ma yi mo. Onzu u zɛma mu ipwu e yi mbaa e sheyi mo. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />La lu shidu mu ɛbɛ ɛlɛ tabɔkɔ lu degbo lu yi mbala yi ele, kaa la lu kwu ɛmɛ umba ɛbɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Azhu O Kwidufulo Mu Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e so ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a ke nvye ɛwu ma.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ɔzhizɔsi e wo apula iyi amɛ iyɛku mu eyi mbo lala, o kwu idu lu fulo mawu mo. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ɛlɛ i nyɔlɔ iso iyi anukenzu Azaya e so tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, uwe a nyama la ilɔ nzu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Uwe ba o zɔ wu ekpasu iyi Ukpo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Kwuyi ungwu kwu shi ba o kwu idu lu fulo mo le, kyamate ba Azaya a ka kpɔ mu riyi ingyifo tee: <verse eid="JHN 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />Ukpo e se mbo eyi mo, akwɛyi e shi egbo mbo i kɔma, kaa eyi mbo li ma ɛbɛ mo, naa lo zɔngɔma mu egbo mbo mo, naa lo bo nyama la mi akwɛyi Mii gba mba ma iyɔkpɔɔ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Anukenzu Azaya e siso ɛlɛ kwuwongu a ma inzumbɛku iyi Ɔzhizɔsi le akwɛyi ba a ba eza wu.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Tetete, enzu riba meka iyi enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu lala o kwu idu o fulo ma wu. Ba kwuwongu Afarisi, o nyama te o so yi gedegede mo, moo o wiyi te oo wa mba ma mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kwuwongwu o gyi ipwɔma iyi enzu i ka iyi Ukpo ma.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iso Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Ii Zɔ Ombwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e siso mu opwu uwɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba onzu a nyama la mi, akwu Imi gba a nya mi kɛɛki le mo, e kyo a nyama la onzu uwu a lɔ mi le. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Onzu uwu a ma mi, e yi mu onzu uwu a lɔ mi imama tete. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mi bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ te la mi kwangwu ɛbɛ, kaa onzu uwunawuna uwu a nyama la mi la ŋɔ mu ipwu mo.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Gba Enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu iso mi mo, akwu Imi gba mii zɔ mba ombu le mo, moo mi bo te la mi zɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ ombu mo, mi bo te la mi sa ngwu ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e towo mi mo mbala iso mi e yi u zɔ wu ombu; iso mi ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ mi so awu gba Ukpo e yi wu ombu ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu imbwambwa ma yi le. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Moo iso iyi bɔkɔ mi so le, Ada uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi awu gba e shi mi ɔkpa te la mi so le. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Imi mi yitu te ɔkpa wu ee shi ŋɔ kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, iso iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ mi so yi, akwiyi bɔkɔ Ada a zɔ te la mi so le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Gbɔ Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu Alɛ Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Tabɔkɔ odumudumu uwu ikalama a ndafo, Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu te kwuyengwu a lafya la kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la gba le so mbaa ete wu kwu bo o, uwu e pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu wu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu, e koko e pwu idɛnyi mba nzhii ba mu imbwama.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Bɔkɔ o yi mu kiya irimo ingyi onoyo, onzu uwoyi ba e shi Ozhuda umɛ uwu Ɔsamɔ uwu Isikariyɔ egbo iyi ka la ya kwoya ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi ma-a. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu te Ete wu e shi wu ekpasu mu ingyinangyina, a gba e yitu te uwu e ngyi mbaa Ukpo, aa gba e rimo mbaa Ukpo. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Akwɛyi e yimo a lafya la mba bɔkɔ e yi mu kiya irimo awu, akwɛyi a lu origa wu uwu kwudu ma akwɛyi a ma kwotawele muzhi wu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Akwɛyi e fu embyi mu kwɔbulɛ akwɛyi e le mu alɛ iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu igbɔma, akwɛyi a nwu yi ma mu kwotawele ungwu bɔkɔ a ma muzhi wu awu. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Kwuye ugu e bo mbaa Ɔsamɔ Opita, a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, uŋɔ mafyi ŋɔ gba ŋɔ gbɔ mi alɛ ma le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu iwomo kekelele ŋɔ di zɔngɔma yi ma mo, ɔnɔnuwa ba ŋɔ zɔngɔma yi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Opita a za wu te &lt;&lt;Imi mii nyama te kaa gbɔ alɛ mi ma gbee mo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ nyama te la mi gbɔ ŋɔ alɛ ma mo, ŋɔ kwu uwa mi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Akwɛyi Opita a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, akwu alɛ mi kɛɛkyi mo, ewo mbala reshi mi kyo ka gbɔ yi ma tete!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba Ɔsamɔ Opita opwu te, &lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e womo-o, alɛ wu kɛɛkyi gba ee wo te ka la gbɔ yi ma le; ɛnwu wu ngyɔɔ i yi sɛsɛ. Lunyi ba lu yi sɛsɛ-ɛ, ukpɛnyi mekeka yi ba e yi sɛsɛ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Moo e yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ba ya kwoya wu, gba i shi a zɔ te, akwu lɛɛbi yi gba lu yi sɛsɛ le mo.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa Wavɔngɔkiya wu alɛ igbɔma, akwɛyi a gba la origa wu ilomo akwɛyi a gba a ka ŋɔma mu riyi wu. Akwɛyi e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Iyi bɔkɔ mi wo yi kekelele le, lu zɔngɔma yi ma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />&lt;&lt;Lunyi lu ya mi te, &lt;U zɔ kiya&gt; mbala &lt;Ɔkwu,&gt; ee lu ya yi kyaa, moo te gba mi kwu le. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Moo gba Imi, Ɔkwu mbala U zɔ kiya yi a gbɔ alɛ yi ma, lunyi tete la lu gbɔ alɛ iyi esu ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Kwuwongwu Imi mi zɔ yi kiya ingyi lu vɔngɔ munyi mi, tee la lu wo kyamate bɔkɔ mi wo yi awu. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Imi mi so yi ongbulolo, Umɛgba aa ka adakwogba wu ma mo, nana ɔlɔgbulɔ a ka onzu uwu a lɔ wu ma mo. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Bɔkɔ lu yitu iyi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi ele, Ukpo ee shi yi esheshi wu gba lu mbwalu yi.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />&lt;&lt;Akwu lɛɛbi yi gba mi so yi le mo, Imi mi yitu iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ mi ŋa mba. Ɛlɛ ba i wo te kaa iso iyi Ukpo lakwu nyɔlɔma le te: &lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ri kiya ingyirimo mbala mi, a gba e kwu mami.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Imi mi so yi ɛlɛ keyi dɛ ishi i bi wo le, kaa kwuyengwu bɔkɔ i bi wo akwɛyi lu yitu te &lt;Imi mi kwu uwu bɔkɔ mi kwu.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na ɔlɔgbulɔ mi onzu awu a na mi; onzu uwu a na onzu uwu bɔkɔ mi lɔ wu ma, awu a na onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Mɛka Iyi Onzu Uwu A Ya Kwoya Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Omatiyu 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Omaki 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Oluku 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Mizhikembo iyi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo, Ɔzhizɔsi e wo ubugyi gyɔɔ mu kwundu akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Imi mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu ukpɛnyi meka yi e to mi a yama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yese esu, ba o zɔngɔma onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iso isomo meka wu mo. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />U vɔngɔ kiya uwu O Ɔzhizɔsi bɔkɔ a gyi awu a ŋɔ kɛlɛɛ mbala wu mɔmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Akwɛyi Ɔsamɔ Opita e wo u vɔngɔ kiya awu kwuwo tee, &lt;&lt;Yo wu kwuyo te iso ɛlɛ e so mu reshi ingyi uwe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Uwu ba a wɛlɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi e yo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, akwu uwe ngyɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu Opwu te, &lt;&lt;Mizhikembo iyi mi kpa kwoburedi mu ɔsɔ, mii shi ngwu onzu awu.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a kpa kiya ingyirimo ngyɛgyi mu ɔsɔ, akwɛyi e shi ngwu Ozhudasi Isikariyɔ, umɛ uwu Ɔsamɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Tabɔkɔ Ozhudasi e ri kiya ingyirimo ngyɛgyi ma, akwɛyi onzu uwoyi e fye mu egbo wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi egbo iyi iwomo awu, gyakpɔɔ mu iwomo,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Onzu uwunawuna te meka iyi umba bɔkɔ o ŋɔma mba kiya irimo awu a zɔngɔma iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu isomo mo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Enzu umbafo mbo o zɔ mu egbo mbo te, kwuwongu Ozhudasi a ra la kakyɔ mba gba Ɔzhizɔsi e ye wu mu isomo te la ya ewiri iyi enzu umba o yi ugɔ mu odumudumu, nana le to eduwo le shi ayirewa le. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ozhudasi a na kwoburedi mo, akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu iyawu kɛlɛlɛ. Kwuye kwɔngu aku utu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkpa Uwepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ozhudasi a kama, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Kekelele gba akwu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Umɛ uwu Onzu aa fya inzumbɛku ma le; akwɛyi meka wu gba inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo ii ta pee le. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Akwiyi gba Ukpo a fya iduma kwuwongu Umɛ, Ukpo mafyi wu ee shi Umɛ uwu Onzu inzumbɛku, ɛlɛ ba Ukpo ee wo yi kekelele.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />&lt;&lt;Ɛmɛ mi, mi ŋɔ mbala yi ngbɛɛ fo. Lunyi luu gagyi mi, mate bɔkɔ mi so Azhu awu gba mi so yi le te: Mba bɔkɔ mi sheyimo, lunyi lu domo te lu re mɔmɔ mo.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ɛrama iyepo gba mii shi yi le tee: la lu gyesu. Kyamate bɔkɔ imi mi gyi yi awu, lunyi la lu gyesu mega. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ gba u zɔ te lu kwu Wavɔngɔkiya mi le, akwiyi gba lu gyesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Tee Opita A Zɔ Kwu zɔ Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Omatiyu 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Omaki 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Oluku 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Ɔsamɔ Opita e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, ŋɔ sheye muna?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Mba bɔkɔ mi sheyi ele, uŋɔ ŋɔ do te ŋɔ mbwalu mi kekelele mo, kwuye kwowa ba ŋɔ mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Opita e yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ mi domo te mi rimo mbala ŋa kekelele mo? Moo imi mi nyama te mi kpomo kwuwo ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ nyama te ŋɔ kpomo kwuwo mi? Mi so ŋɔ ongbulolo, ŋɔ zɔ kwu zɔ mi izhɛla dɛ gba okwuru e tɛyi le!<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Ɔgwuzɛ Uwu U Re Mbaa Ada Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee &lt;&lt;la lu shi egbo yi mɛzhi. La lu kwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo; la lu kwu idu lu fulo mami tete. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mu kwogba ungwu Ada mi igwu iyi iŋɔma i yi gyɔɔ; la akwu tayi mo, de ba la mi bi so yi te mo, mi rimo kaa la mi nɔngɔ riyi ma ka mi she yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Gba mi mbwa riyi inɔngɔma shi yi, akwɛyi mii gbama mi kwu yi ma mi reye munyi mi, akwɛyi lu yi mbala mi iyɔkpɔɔ . <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Lunyi lu yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu u zɛ u sheye mbaa bɔkɔ mi sheyimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Otoma a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, kinzu ki yitu mba bɔkɔ ŋɔ sheyimo mo, ki wo la ba ki yi ɔgwuzɛ ɔwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi kwu ɔgwuzɛ, mbala ongbulolo mbala kwunyɔ le. Onzu uwu e domo te e re mbaa Ada e yi mo, gba a zɛ mbaa mi mo. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ gba lu yitu mi, lu yitu iyi Ada mi tete. Te i na mu ɔnɛ le, lunyi lu yi wu lu gba lu ma wu oo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Ofilipu a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, zɔ nzu Ada ŋa nɛ, moo iyi bɔkɔ ki gyi gba i ŋɔ awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee: &lt;&lt;Ngbɛɛ bɔkɔ mi yi mbala yi te, ŋɔ degbo ŋɔ di yitu mye moo Ofilipu? Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ma mi, Ukpo Adami gba a ma le tete. I wo la bɔkɔ ŋɔ za mi te la mi zɔ yi Ada? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Uŋɔ ŋɔ nyama te Imi mi yi mɛmi iyi Ada, Ada ba e yi mami tete mo re? Iso iyi mi so yi awu akwu iyami mo, akwiyi Ada, uwu e yi mami awu gba e yi mu ɛlɛ iwomo le. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />La lu nyama la mi ma gba mi za yi te, Imi mi yi mɛmi iyi Ada, Ada ba e yi mami tete; gba ba akwu tayi mo lala ba la lu nyama la mi kwuwongu apula iyi amɛ iyi bɔkɔ mi wo le. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Imi mi so yi ongbulolo tee, gba onzu e kwu idu lu fulo mami, e do ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu iwomo le mo. Kwuwongwu mi gba mi sheyimo mbaa Adami, gba onzu e kwu idu lu fulo mami, ee wo iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛlɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Imi ba mii wo iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ lu nda mu ɛnyi mi, kaa Umɛ le shi Ada la fya inzumbɛku ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Gba lu nda kiya ingyinangyina mu ɛnyi mi, Imi mii wo yi ngyi.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso E Shi Mɛzhi Tee Aa Ka Mba Laa Kwundu Uwu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Gba lu gyi mi, lu mbwalu kaza mi. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Akwɛyi mii nda Adami Ukpo kwoya, akwɛyi ee shi yi U mbwama uwufo uwu bɔkɔ ee yi mbala yi iyɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />U mbwama ele gba akwu Kwundu u zɔ enzu ongbulolo le. Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o na wu mo, kwuwongu umba o zɔngɔma wu ma mo ba o yitu wu mo. Lunyi ba lu yi wu kwuwongu e yi mbala yi ba e yi mɛmi yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Imi mi ŋi lu yi afyima mate ɛmɛ umbese tayi mo; mii gbama mi nyɔ munyi yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Kwuye bwɛɛ te, enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ oo ma mi fo, lunyi ba lu ma mi, kwuwongu Imi mi ye la reyi awu, lunyi tete luu ye la reyi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Gba kwɔfyi kwɔngu kwu bo, lu zɔngɔma te Imi mi yi mu Ada, lunyi lu yi ma mi, Imi ba mi yi ma yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a na iso mi ba a mbwalu yi, onzu awu gba a gyi mi le. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyi mi, Ada mi a gyi wu; Imi tete mi gyi wu akwɛyi mii shi te e yi mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Akwɛyi Ozhudasi (akwu Ozhudasi Isikariyɔ awu mo) e yo Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, ŋɔ yi egbo iyi ŋɔ zɔ ɛŋɔ ma la nzu, kimbe ki shi ba ŋɔ zɔ ɛŋɔ ma la enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba onzu a gyi mi, onzu awu a mbwalu ɛzɔ mi. Ada mi a gyi wu, kinzu ki nyɔ munyi wu akwɛyi kii ŋɔ mbala wu. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Onzu uwu ba a gyi mi mo, a mbwalu ɛzɔ mi mo. Iso iyi mi so yi ele akwu iyami mo, i ngyi mba Ada mi uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi awu.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Imi mi so yi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi kwuwongu mi degbo mbala yi bɛnɛ ke. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ada ba a lɔ U mbwama, Kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri, mu ɛnyi mi aa ka yi, ka la zɔ yi apula lɛɛbi iyi i fa te la lu yitu yi, akwɛyi e lolo yi apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ mi zɔ yi.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />&lt;&lt;Oloto gba mi lu wu yi afyima le; oloto uwami gba mi shi yi le. Oloto uwu bɔkɔ mi shi yi akwu mate bɔkɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ kwuu shi le mo. La lu shi egbo yi li fomo mo ba la lu riyi mo. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Lunyi lu pwa mi mi so yi tee, &lt;&lt;Mi lu yi afyima akwɛyi mi gba mi nyɔ munyi yi.&gt; Gba lu gyi mi, lu mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu mi sheye mba Ada mi; kwuwongu Ada a ka mi ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Imi mi so ɛlɛ kekelele le kaa kwuyengwu lu ma te i wɔ tayi akwɛyi lu nyama la mi. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Imi mi yi kwuye gyɔɔ ungwu mi so yi iso fo, kwuwongu onzu uwoyi ɔsu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ e yi mu inyɔma. Onzu uwoyi ele e yi ekpasu mu reshi mi mo, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />akwɛyi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o zɔngɔma ma te mi gyi Ada mi, Imi ba mi mbwalu iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ Ada mi a za mi te la mi wo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">La ki yimo la ki lafya la riyi ngyɛlɛ kekelele.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Uwɛyi Uwu Ovanyi Shɛ Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi kwu uwɛyi uwu ovanyi ureyi le, Adami gba akwu ɔnɛgba le. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kwuwɛyi ungwunanguna ungwu bɔkɔ kwu wa la imuma mo, Ada e kpolo ngwu mo. Kwonde ungwu bɔkɔ kwu wa la imuma ba, aa vyɛ ngwu ma kaa lakwu muma gyɔɔ lakwu kyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Lunyi lu wuluma kwuwongu iso iyi bɔkɔ mi so yi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Lunyi la lu ŋɔ mami, Imi ba mii yi ma yi. Kwonde ungwu kwu wa la imuma lɛngwu kwu yi mo, akwu mɛga te kwu bɔ mu uwɛyi mafyi ngwu. Tatayi, lunyi lu yi mami mɛga gba luu wa la imuma le.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi yi mate utu uwu uwɛyi tayi, lunyi ba lu yi mate ende tayi. Akwiyi gba onzu e yi mami akwɛyi Imi ba mi yi ma wu, onzu awu aa wa la imuma; moo gba akwu mbala mi mo, lu do kiya ikpikpɛnyi te iwomo mo. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Akwiyi gba onzu e yi mami mo, oo masa wu mbala kwonde ungwu o ta ngwa pyo akwɛyi kwu shirima; akwɛyi enzu ɔ kwu ende ɛnyi ma akwɛyi oo fu yi mɔyi akwɛyi ipwumo. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Akwiyi gba lu yi ma mi akwɛyi lu shi iso mi mu egbo yi, la lu nda kiya ingyinangyina, akwɛyi Ukpo ba ee shi yi ngyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Adami aa fya inzumbɛku ma gba lu wa la imuma iyɛku, iyi bɔkɔ i zɔ te lu kwu Wavɔngɔkiya mi. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />&lt;&lt;Kyamate bɔkɔ Ada mi a gyi mi awu, tatayi gba Imi mi gyi yi le tete. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu rima mu idɛnyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Gba lu lomo la ɔkpa mi, luu ŋɔ mu idɛnyi mi, mate bɔkɔ mi mi lomo la ɔkpa uwu Ada mi akwɛyi mi yi mu idɛnyi wu awu.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Imi mi so yi ɛlɛ le te kaa ɔnyɛ yi le yi mate uwami, akwɛyi ɔnyɛ yi a nyɔlɔma. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ɔkpa mi gba e yi te: la lu gyesu mate bɔkɔ mi gyi yi awu. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Idɛnyi iyi i ka ɛlɛ ma i yi mo, tee onzu ee shi kwunyɔ wu kwuwongu umɛza wu. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Gba lu wo iyi bɔkɔ mi za yi te la lu wo, de ba lu kwu ɛmɛza mi. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Imi mii ya yi te enye fo, moo enye o yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ada kwogba mba e yi mu iwomo mo. Imi ba mi ya yi te ɛmɛza mi ŋa, kwuwongu mi so yi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ Ada mi e so mi. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Akwu lunyi gba lu ŋa mi le mo, akwu mi gba mi ŋa yi le akwɛyi mii shi yi ɛduma iyi ka la lu wo ka la lu wa la imuma gyɔɔ kyamate ɛwɛyi tayi, imuma iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyɔkpɔɔ. Akwɛyi Ada mi ee shi yi ingyinangyina ingyi lu nda mu ɛnyi mi. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ɔkpa mi gba akwu tee: la lu gyesu.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu Umba Kwudu Kwɔlɛ O Wo Anya Iyi Wambwalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />&lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o wo anya yi, la lu yitu te o wo anya mi keyi dɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Gba la lu kwu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o bo gyi yi kwuwongu lu kwu umba mba. Lunyi lu kwu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ fo, imi ba mi ŋa yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ka la lu kwu umba mi. Akwu mu kuyi kwɔlɛ gba kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu towo yi mo le. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />la lu lolo mu iso iyi bɔkɔ mi so yi te: &lt;Umɛgba a ka adakwogba wu ma mo.&gt; Akwiyi gba o lo mi inyashi, umba o lo yi inyashi tete. Akwiyi gba o lomo la iso mi, umba o lomo la iso yi tete. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Umba oo wo yi ɛlɛ te kwuwongu lu nyama la mi, moo umba o yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi le mo. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Gba la mi bo kaa la mi so mbo iso iyi Ukpo mo, Ukpo le bo yi mbo ombu uwu ingbomo mo. Ta i yi kekelele te, o yi kwuyi ungwu ngbomo mbo fo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Onzu uwu e towo mi mo, e towo Adami ma tete. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Gba la mi wo apula iyi amɛ mekeka mba iyi bɔkɔ onzu e do wo yi dɛ mo mo, Ukpo le bo yi mbo ombu uwu ingbomo mo. Umba ba o ma mi mu ɛlɛ iwomo lɛɛbi, umba ba o towo mi mo mbala Ada mi tete. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ɛlɛ i wo te kaa iso iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ o ka yi ma awu li nyɔlɔma te: &lt;Umba o yi kuyi ungwu bɔkɔ o wo anya mi mo ndii.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />&lt;&lt;Imi mii ka yi la U mbwama uwu bɔkɔ Ada a lɔ, uwu akwu Kwundu u so yi ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ e ngyi mbaa Ada, uwu a zɔ yi ongbulolo meka mi. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Lunyi tete luu ba eza iyami iyi bɔkɔ lu yitu, kwuwongu lu yi mbala mi ngbaa mu iyemo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt; Mi so yi apula ɛlɛ kwuwongu ka la lu gba kembo mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Moo o ra yi ma mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu; kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma ungwu bɔkɔ onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ngbɛ yi ma e to tee e yi mu ɛduma iwomo laa Ukpo. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Oo wo apula ɛnyi kwuwongu o yitu iyi Ada naa Imi mo.<verse eid="JHN 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛduma Iyi Kwundu Uwu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Mi so yi apula ɛlɛ, kwuwongu gba kwuye kwɔngu kwu bo ba o wo ɛlɛ, lunyi la lu lolo te mi so yi ɛlɛ. Mi so yi apula ɛlɛ kwuyengwu kwonze mo kwuwongu Imi mi yi mbala yi bɛnɛ.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛduma Iyi Kwundu Uwu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Kekelele mi sheyimo mba onzu uwu a lɔ mi ma, ɔbulɛ ŋa onzu ukpukpɛnyi yi te e yo mi mba mi sheyimo mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kwuwongwu mi so yi apula ɛlɛ le, akwɛyi lu nyɔlɔma la ubugyi. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Imi ba mi so yi ongbulolo: Akwu kwuwo yi gba mi sheyimo le. Moo mi kama mo, U mbwama awu a nyɔ mo; gba ba mi kama, mi lɔ wu akwɛyi a nyɔ munyi yi. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ U mbwama awu e bo, a zɔ enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ingbomo mbo mbala ototo mbala ombu izɔma uwu Ukpo: <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />meka iyi ingbomo mbo, kwuwongu o kwu idu lu fulo mami mo; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />meka iyi ototo, kwuwongu Imi mi sheyimo mba Ada, mbaa bɔkɔ lu ma mi fo; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />meka iyi ombu izɔma, kwuwongu utokeyi uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ o to ombu o ri wu-o. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi yi apula gyɔɔ i yi mi so yi, lunyi ba lu do yi irima kekele le mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Kwuye ungwu Kwundu uwu ongbulolo ba e bo, uwu a zɔ yi ongbulolo meka iyi Ukpo, e to yi keyi meka iyi ongbulolo lɛɛbi. Uwu e siso iyi afyi wu mo; e siso iyi bɔkɔ a pwa mbala iyi bɔkɔ i bi wo. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ee shi mi inzumbɛku, kwuwongu e to iso iyi bɔkɔ mi so akwɛyi e so yi. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />I yi bɔkɔ akwiyi Ada lɛɛbi akwu iya mi. Ɛlɛ gba i shi imi mi zɔ te Kwundu e to meka iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingya mi akwɛyi a zɔ yi ngyi le.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwugyi Aa Vindɔ Ɔnyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye bwɛ lu ma mi fo, akwɛyi kwuye bwɛ lu gba lu ma mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Wambwalu wu umbafo o le mu esu kwuyo iyomo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba akwu iluma iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ tee, &lt;Kwuye kwu shi bwɛ luu ma mi fo, akwɛyi kwuye bwɛ lu gba lu ma mi,&gt; &lt;Kwuwongwu Imi mi sheyimo mba Ada&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />O le mu eyo iyomo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba akwu iluma iyi &lt;kwuye bwɛ&gt;? Ki zɔngɔma iso iyi bɔkɔ e yi mu isomo le ma mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ma te o gyi te lo yo kwuyo meka iyi ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lu yi mu esu eyo iyomo iyi iluma iyi iso iyi Imi mi zɔ te, &lt;Kwuye kwu shi bwɛ luu ma mi fo, akwɛyi kwuye bwɛ lu ma mi?&gt; Ɛlɛ gba lu yi mu esu iyomo le? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Mi so yi ongbulolo, lu lo oga, lu wo obobyi, enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ba ɔ mwɔnyɛ. Lu wo ubugyi, ubugyi awu ba aa vindɔ ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />kwuyengwu oko e yi mu kwomba iwomo, a ma wɔnu mu kwuye kwɔngu; kwuyengwu bɔkɔ a mba umɛ ma ba a kala kuleyi la wɔnu umbwu a ma kwuwongu ɔnyɛ uwu umɛ uwu bɔkɔ a mba mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Tatayi gba i yi le munyi yi: kekelele akwu kwuyengwu ubugyi yi, Imi ba mi ma yi kpɔ akwɛyi lu mwɔnyɛ, onzu ukpukpɛnyi te ba a na yi ɔnyɛ awu ma mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Ɔnuwu bɔkɔ kwɔfyi kwɔngu ku bo, lu yo kwuyo ungwu kiya kikpikpɛnyi te fo. Mi so yi ongbulolo: Ada mi ee shi yi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ lu nda mu ɛnyi mi. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Kekelele te lu du nda kiya ingyinangyina mu ɛnyi mi-aa mo. La lu nda akwɛyi luu na, akwɛyi lu mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mi Bi Kwudu Kwɔlɛ Ma-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi ye yi mu iso isomo mu aba, kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma bɔkɔ mi so yi iso mu aba fo, Imi ba mi so yi iso kyoriri meka iyi Ada. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mu kwɔfyi kwɔngu luu nda Ukpo meka iyi ɛnyi mi. Imi mi zɔ te mii nda Ada kwoya kwuwo yi mo, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />moo Ada mafyi wu e pwu idɛnyi yi kwuwongu lu pwu idɛnyi mi, akwɛyi lu kwu idu lu fulo te mi wɔ mba Ukpo. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Mi wɔ mba Ada akwɛyi mi bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ; kekelele mi ŋi lafya la kwudu kwɔlɛ akwɛyi mi gba mi sheye mba Ada.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Akwɛyi wa mbwalu wu o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kekelele gba ŋɔ yi mu iso isomo kyoriri ŋa le, ba akwu mu aba mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Kekelele ki yitu o te ŋɔ yitu iyi apula lɛɛbi; uŋɔ ŋɔ kagyi onzu ukpukpɛnyi te kaa le yo ŋɔ eyo mo. Ɛlɛ i shi nzu ki kwu idu ki fulo te ŋɔ wɔ mbaa Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lu kwu idu fulo kekelele-e re? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Kwuye ba kwu yi mu inyɔma, ba kwu bo-o, lu kpashaa, onzonzu e re mogba wu akwɛyi ɔ lu mi afyima kɛɛkyi mi. Tetete mi yi kɛɛkyi mi mo, moo Ada mi e yi mbala mi.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />&lt;&lt;Mi so yi apula ɛlɛ, kaa meka mi luu yi idigbomo. Mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lu ma inyashi. Lunyi ba la lu yi idu! Mi bi kwudu kwɔlɛ ma-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɛ Ukpo Laa Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo, e yese moshi akwɛyi a zɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Ada mi, kwuye kwu bo-o. Shi Umɛ ŋɔ inzumbɛku, kaa Umɛ ŋɔ ba le shi ŋɔ inzumbɛku tete. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Moo ŋɔ shi wu idomo meka iyi enzu lɛɛbi kaa le shi enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi wu awu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ kwɔlɛ: akwu kaa lo yitu ŋɔ te, uŋɔ kɛɛkyi gba ŋɔ kwu Ukpo ongbulolo le, mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ lɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Mi bo la inzumbɛku mu kwudu kwɔlɛ i zɛ meka iyi ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi te kaa la mi wo. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Kekelele, Ada, shi mi inzumbɛku midu ŋɔ mbala inzumbɛku iyi bɔkɔ mi yi yi mbala ŋa keyi ngba mu iyemo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ awu.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />&lt;&lt;Mi ra ŋa mi zɔ umba bɔkɔ ŋɔ ra mba ŋɔ shi mi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le. O kwu umba ŋa; ŋɔ shi mi mbo akwɛyi umba ba o lo iso ŋɔ mo. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Kekelele o yitu te apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi i wɔ munyi ŋɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Moo mi shi mbo rɛnu ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi akwɛyi o na ngyi ma. O yitu yi marimari te mi wɔ munyi ŋɔ, akwɛyi o na yi ma te uŋɔ gba ŋɔ lɔ mi ma le iyesheshi. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Mii lɛ Ukpo kwuwo mbo. Imi mi yi mu Ukpo ilɛma kwuwongu enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, Imi mii lɛ kwuwongu enzu umba bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi mbo le, moo o kwu umba ŋa. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />I yi bɔkɔ mi yi yi lɛɛbi akwu iyaŋa, iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi yi lɛɛbi ba akwu iya mi. Akwɛyi inzumbɛku i bo munyi mi i zɛ meka mba. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Mi yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ fo, umba ba o yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ bɛnɛ, Imi mi yi mu inyɔma munyi ŋɔ. Ada Ɔkɛrikɛri, gbo mbo mo meka iyi ekpasu iyi ɛnyi ŋɔ ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi kwuwongu kaa lo kwu wakpɛnyi kyamate bɔkɔ uŋɔ mbala mi ki kwu wakpɛnyi awu. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ mi yi mbala mba bɛnɛ, Mi gbo mbo mo, mi gba mi sa mba ma mu ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi awu. Onzu ukpukpɛnyi mba te e tomo mo, uwu bɔkɔ o ka te e tomo awu kɛɛkyi kaa kwokpo ungwu Ukpo lakwu nyɔlɔma . <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />&lt;&lt;Mi yi mu inyɔma munyi ŋɔ kekelele-e, Imi ba mi so apula ɛlɛ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ bɛnɛ, kwuwongu ka lo yi inyɔlɔma iyi ɔnyɛ mi meka mba. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mi shi mbo rɛnu ŋɔ akwɛyi kwudu kwɔlɛ ba kwu towo mbo mo, moo umba o kwu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ fo, kyamate bɔkɔ Imi mi kwu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo awu. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Mi lɛ te ka wa mba ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, uŋɔ ba gbo mbo mo mba Onzu uwoyi awu. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />O kwu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, kyamate Imi mi kwu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo awu. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Wulu mba ma mu ongbulolo; iso ŋɔ akwu ongbulolo uwu iso ŋɔ izɔma. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Tabɔkɔ ŋɔ lɔ mi ma mi bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu, mi lɔ mba ma kaa lo so mu kwudu kwɔlɛ tete. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Akwu kwuwo mbo gba mi wulu ɛnwu mi ma le, kaa umba tete lo wuluma shɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />&lt;&lt;Ukpo ilɛma mi akwu kwuwo mbo kɛɛkyi mo. Mi lɛ Ukpo kwuwongu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu idu lu fulo ma mi i zɛ mu ilɔ iyesheshi mba. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Mi lɛ Ukpo te lɛɛbi mba o kwu wakpɛnyi. Ada, kyamate bɔkɔ uŋɔ ŋɔ yi meka mi, Imi ba mi yi meka ŋa awu, umba tete lo yi meka nzu kaa kwudu kwɔlɛ lakwu kwu idu lu fulo te uŋɔ ŋɔ lɔ mi ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Mi shi mbo inzumbɛku iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi awu, kaa lo kwu wakpɛnyi kyamate bɔkɔ uŋɔ mbala mi ki kwu wakpɛnyi awu: <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Imi mi yi ma ŋa, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ yi ma mi. Kwuwongwu kaa lo kwu wakpɛnyi kaa kwudu kwɔlɛ lakwu yitu te ŋɔ lɔ mi ma akwɛyi mi pwu idɛnyi mba kyamate bɔkɔ ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi mi tayi.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Ada, imi gyi te enzu umba bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi mbo kaa lo yi mbala mi mba bɔkɔ Mi yi, ka lo ma inzumbɛku mi, inzumbɛku iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi kwuwongu ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi mi keyi kaa wo kwudu kwɔlɛ awu. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />&lt;&lt;Ada mi Ototo! Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o yitu ŋɔ mo, tetete imi mi yitu ŋɔ, umba ba o yitu te uŋɔ gba ŋɔ lɔ mi le. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Mi zɔ ŋɔ ma la enzu-o, mi koko mi zɔ ŋɔ ma kaa idɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi yi kwuwo mi awu li yi ma mba kaa Imi mafyi mi la mi yi mamba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">O Yi Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Omatiyu 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Omaki 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Oluku 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa Ukpo ilɛma akwɛyi e fulomo mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o sa kwuvɔ ungwu Ɔkidirɔ ma. Mu kwuko ungufo mɔmɔ ba akwu utu uwepwu iyi ɔlifu, akwɛyi uwu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o fye mɔmɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Ozhuda uwu bɔkɔ a ya kwoya wu awu, e yitu iyi kizɛ ngyɛngyi, kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi e koko e kpolo esu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu mɔmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ Ozhuda a ka mu utu uwepwu mɔmɔ, mbala uzhi uwu asozha umba Oroma mbala wa gbo ɔtɛpu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mba wa to keyi umba ebwoshi mbala Afarisi. O za la etoshi, kambyɔyi mbala ewulo iyi ewa.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ ii bi du wu awu, akwɛyi e turu a fa mba akwɛyi e yo mbo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Uwe bɔ lu kagyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />O gba wu opwu o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi ŋɔ le.&gt;&gt; (Ozhuda uwu bɔkɔ akwu u ya kwoya ungwu onzu awu a rima mɔmɔ mbala mba.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi ŋɔ le&gt;&gt; akwɛyi o gba kembo akwɛyi o fu mɛzhi.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />E yo mbo kwuyo kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba lu kagyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Akwɛyi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi za yi te, Imi gba mi ŋɔ le&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba lu ye mye mu ikagyima, de ba la lu lafya la enzu mbɔlɛ ka lo sheyimo iya mba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ɛlɛ i wo te kaa iso iyi bɔkɔ e so awu li nyɔlɔma te: &lt;&lt;Umba bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi mi mbo awu o tomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔsayimɔ Opita, uwu bɔkɔ a rala Ɔkpadɛrɛ, a wala nga ma akwɛyi e kpolo kwɔlu ungwu ungyi ungwu unye uwu obwoshi uwakɔ ma. Unye awu o ya wu tee Ɔmalikɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Opita te, &lt;&lt;Gba la Ɔkpadɛrɛ ŋɔ lo mu ayuwɛ nga! Mi wo ago iyi bɔkɔ Ada e shi mi le mo re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O To Ɔzhizɔsi O Ka Wu Mbaa Anasi Oboshi Uwakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Akwɛyi uzhi uwu Asozha mbala u to keyi mbo mbala wagbo ɔtɛpu umba Azhu o yi Ɔzhizɔsi ma. O ma wu ma <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />akwɛyi o bo wu mba Anasi keyi dɛ, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ete uwu oko uwu Okayafasi, uwu bɔkɔ akwu obwoshi uwakɔ kari kanga awu. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Okayafasi gba akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ta wa to keyi mba Azhu amasa te, ishoshi ika akwiyi gba onzu ukpɛnyi e kpomo kwuwongu enzu lɛɛbi.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita A Zɔ Kwu zɔ Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69">Omatiyu 26.69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Omaki 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Oluku 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Ɔsayimɔ Opita mbala u vɔngɔ kiya uwufo o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi. Kwuwongwu Oboshi uwakɔ e yitu iyi u vɔngɔ kiya ele , a ka mbala Ɔzhizɔsi mu ufiri uwu obwoshi uwakɔ awu, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Opita ba a ri mu kwudu mba kenzugu. u vɔngɔ kiya uwufo uwu bɔkɔ obwoshi uwakɔ e yitu wu awu, a gba kembo, akwɛyi e siso mbala umɛ okokpayi uwu bɔkɔ e gbo kenzugu mɔmɔ awu akwɛyi o fye laa Opita ma mɛmi.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Umɛ okokpayi uwu bɔkɔ e gbo kenzugu awu e yo Opita kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ kwu onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya umba onzu awu mo re?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Akwɛyi Opita a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ayi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Okpakyi e yi mu i yimo akwɛyi ɛmɛgba mbala adakari o kpala ɔyi uwu alanga o ri mu ivyemo . Opita a ka e rima mbala mba tete, mu ɔyi ivyemo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oboshi Uwakɔ E Yo Ɔzhizɔsi Eyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Omatiyu 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Omaki 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Oluku 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Oboshi uwakɔ e yo Ɔzhizɔsi eyo meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu mbala ɛzɔ wu.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Mi koko mi zɔ enzu mbanambana ɛzu gedegede mu idaba iyi Ɛlukpalama mbala ɔtɛpu mba bɔkɔ Azhu lɛɛbi o kpalɛlu. Mi so iso ikpikpɛnyi mu invyemo mo. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ luu yo mi eyo? La lu yo enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso mi awu. O yitu shɛ iyi iso iyi mi so.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so tayi, akwɛyi odakari uwu bɔkɔ a ri kɛlɛ mbala Ɔzhizɔsi a kpa wu afyi mu eyi. Akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Tegba ŋɔ gba opwu la obwoshi uwakɔ lee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba mi siso mi ta yi ma de ba za la onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi munɛ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyira. Akwiyi gba ba mi so ongbulolo, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔ kpa mi afyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Akwɛyi Anasi a lɔ ma tee lo gba Ɔzhizɔsi akyi kaa lo so wu mbaa Okayafasi obwoshi uwakɔ<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita A Zɔ Kwu zɔ Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi Kpɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Omatiyu 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Omaki 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Oluku 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔsayimɔ Opita a rima mu ɔyi ivyemo, akwɛyi o yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ kwu onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya mba onzu awu mo re?&gt;&gt; Opita ba a zɔma. Azɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ayi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Umɛgba uwu obwoshi uwakɔ ukpɛnyi, onzu uwu kwomba uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Opita e kpolo wu kwɔlu ma awu, e yo kwuyo tee,&lt;&lt;Mi ma ŋa mbala wu mu utu uwepwu iyi ɔlifu moo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Opita a gba a zɔ kwu zɔ kpɔ. A zɔ tee &lt;&lt;Ayimo.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi kɛlɛlɛ okuru e tɛyi.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Rima Mu Keyi Unga Opayileti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Omatiyu 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Omaki 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Oluku 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Akwɛyi enzu umba Azhu o to Ɔzhizɔsi mo mbaa Okayafasi o kawa mu udaba uwu ogwomina uwu Oromu. Kwuye kwɔngu ba akwu kwoto bɛnɛ, kwuwo kwɔlɛ Azhu o fye mu udaba mo, moo o gyite lo wuluma sɛsɛ, kwuwongu ka lo ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi odumudumu uwu ikalama. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Akwɛyi Opayileti a wɔ kwudu e yo mbo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba onzu ele e wo bɔkɔ akwiyira?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba le ngbomo mo, ki ka ŋa wu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Opayileti a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu to wu mo mafyi yi kaa la lu zɔ ombu wu mu ɛrama iya yi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Umba Azhu o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;O shi kapa kaa la ki ngbɛ onzu ukpukpɛnyi ma mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ɛlɛ i wo kaa iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ a zɔ ewo iyi bɔkɔ uwu e be kpomo awu kaa li nyɔlɔma le.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Akwɛyi Opayileti a gba e fyemo iya wu mu udaba, a ya Ɔzhizɔsi ma akwɛyi e yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu ɔsu uwu Azhu lee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuyo kwɔlɛ kwu ngyi mba ŋa naa enzu umbafo gba o ba ŋa eza mi le ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Opayileti a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ mate Imi mi kwu Ozhu re? Akwu enzu ŋɔ mbala ebwoshi umbakɔ gba o to ŋɔ o shi mi le. Kimbe bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛsu mi akwiyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo. Gba la kwiyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, wa mbwalu mi o bo kiri ewa kaa lo sa mi ma mu ewo iyi Azhu mbɔlɛ. Kekelele ba ɛsu mi akwiyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Akwɛyi Opayileti e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Inyete ŋɔ kwu ɔsu ŋa mo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu a zɔ tee &lt;&lt;ongbulolo gba ŋɔ so le te Imi mi kwu ɔsu. Yese de, kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba o mba mi le, a gba akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba mi bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le kaa mi zɔ izɔgɔ iyi ongbulolo. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu kwuko ungwu ongbulolo ee shi alu mba mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ Zɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Ombu Uwu Lukwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Omatiyu 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Omaki 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Oluku 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Opayileti e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba akwu ongbulolo?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu kpɔ a ka mɔgɔ uwu Azhu akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;E ri ombu uwoyi ukpukpɛnyi te mo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Lunyi ba lu yi ukwu uwu bɔkɔ mi koko mi lafya la onzu ukpɛnyi mi shi yi kaa la wɔ ma mu ugu ugyi kwuyengwu odumudumu uwu ikalama. Lu gyi te la mi lafya la &lt;ɔsu uwu Azhu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />O wo ovyo iyɛkɔkɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ayimo, akwu wu mo! Shi nzu Obarabasi!&gt;&gt; Obarabasi awu ba akwu u zɛ kpɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Akwɛyi Opayileti e to Ɔzhizɔsi mo akwɛyi e shi wu te lo fya wu izele. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Asozha o ndo kese unga awula akwɛyi o lo wu yi mu reshi. O kpo wu ɛkiri mɛnwu <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />akwɛyi o bo munyi wu, &lt;&lt;O to wu ɛnyi o za wu tee, ɔsu uwu umba Azhu!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o kpa wu afyi meyi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Opayileti a wɔ kwudu kpɔ akwɛyi a za la Azhu te, &lt;&lt;La lu yese, mi wa wu kwudu kaa mi shi wu yi moo mi ma ingbomo ikpɛnyi te mɔgɔ wu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ kwudu la kese unga awula mbala ɛkiri, Opayileti a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu yese onzu awu a ŋɔ le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Mu kwotota ungwu bɔkɔ obwoshi uwakɔ mbala wa to keyi o ma wu akwɛyi o wo ovyo iyɛkɔkɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi! Kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Opayileti ba a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu to wu kaa la lu kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi. Moo lakwu iya mi, mi ma kwuyi kwukpukpɛnyi te ungwu mi ngbɛ wu ombu uwoyi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Enzu umba Azhu ba o bɔ kpɔɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ki yi ɛrama nzu, akwiyi gba ki mbwalu ɛrama nzu ifate ka le kpomo, kwuwongu a zɔ te uwu akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Opayileti a pwa ɛlɛ, iyi i wo wu mo gyɔɔ, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />a gbama a ka mu udaba. Akwɛyi e yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ wɔ muna?&gt;&gt; Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu mo. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Opayileti a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ so mi iso moo?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ yitu tee mi yi ekpasu iyi bɔkɔ mi lu ŋɔ afyima naa mi kpa ŋa mu kwuwɛyi mo re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ yi ekpasu munyi mi mo akwiyi gba o to o shi ŋɔ wɔ moshi mo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to mi e shi ŋɔ le e yi ingbomo gyɔɔ ka ŋa ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Tabɔkɔ Opayileti a pwa ɛlɛ e wo ka la lafya la Ɔzhizɔsi le, Azhu ba o kpa kpɛɛ mu ovyo iwomo te, &lt;&lt; Akwiyi gba ŋɔ lafya la onzu ele gba a kama, ŋɔ kwu umɛza uwu Osiza mo. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɛnwu tee uwu akwu ɔsu akwu ogewa uwu Osiza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Tabɔkɔ Opayileti a pwa iso ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a wa la Ɔzhizɔsi kwudu akwɛyi a ka ŋɔma mu ukpa uwɛsu mu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ o yitu ngyi te akwu kwoki ungwɔkwu (Mu kenzu unga Iburu o ya ngwu tee Ogabata). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Akwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwuyimo iyi odumudumu uwu ikalama, i yi mate awa ɛrɛnyi te. Akwɛyi Opayileti a za la Azhu te, &lt;&lt;Ɔsu yi a ŋɔ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Umba ba o wo ovyo te. &lt;&lt;Lo ngbɛ wu ma! Lo ngbɛ wu ma! Kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Opayileti e yo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;La mi kpa ɔsu yi mu kwuwɛyi?&gt;&gt; Eboshi umbakɔ o gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki yi ɔsu awa mo, Osiza kɛɛkyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Mu imbwama yi Opayileti e shi wu mbo ka lo kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">O Bɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Iba Mu Kwuwɛyi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Omatiyu 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Omaki 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Oluku 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Kwuwo kwɔlɛ asozha o to Ɔzhizɔsi o kawu ma.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />E shi kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu wu, a ka mu kizɛ ingyi akɔgɔ iyi reshi (iyi bɔkɔ o ya yi mu kenzu unga Iburu te &lt;&lt;Ɔgɔlugɔta.&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Mɔmɔ gba o kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi le, mbala anzɔnu wepo umbafo, uwufo e yi mu kwuwo ungwɔzu uwufo ba e yi mu kwuwo ungwungyi wu akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi mekeka. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Opayileti a ka ɛzu a kpa yi mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. A ka te: ƆZHIZƆSI UWU A WƆ MU ƆNAZARƐTI, ƆSU UWU AZHU. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Azhu gyɔɔ o wa ɛzu ɛlɛ, moo kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ o kpa Ɔzhizɔsi mu kwuwɛyi awu ki yi kɛlɛ mbala kwuse. Kɛzɔ kanga ba o ka nga mu Iburu, Olati mbala Ogiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Eboshi umbakɔ umba Azhu o wo ovyo o ka mbaa Opayileti akwɛyi o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki ka te, &lt;Ɔsu uwu Azhu mo&gt; ka te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele a zɔ te uwu akwu ɔsu uwu Azhu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Opayileti a gba mba opwu a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Iyi mi ka, mi ka-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Kwuye ungwu asozha ba o kpa Ɔzhizɔsi mu kwuwɛyi awu, o lu wu ɛriga ma, o ka yi ma yɛyɛ ikpendo, onzonzu mbo e to kwuko kwukpɛnyi. O to ɔmu wu ma tete, ekpayi ɛlɛ o gbɔ yi ma mo, o yi kwuko kwukpɛnyi ma wɔ mu kadu nzhii ba mɛzhi.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />O so mbala esu te, &lt;&lt;La ki tara yi ma mo&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;La ki fu ovotu kaa la ki ma onzu uwu bɔkɔ a fya kaa lakwu iyawu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Ɛlɛ i wo te kaa iso iyi Ukpo li nyɔlɔma iyi bi zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;O ka ekpayi mi ma laa esu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">akwɛyi o wo ovotu iyi ekpayi mi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ɛlɛ gba akwu kiya ingyi asozha o wo le.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Anyi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi a rima kɛlɛ mba kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu, mbala ɔtumanyi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi, Omeri oko uwu Okilopasi mbala Omeri Omagadali. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma anyi wu mɔmɔ mbala u vɔngɔ kiya wu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi wu awu a rima kɛlɛ mɔmɔ, akwɛyi a za la anyi wu te, &lt;&lt;Okokpayi, yese, umɛ ŋɔ a ŋɔ le&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />akwɛyi a za la u vɔngɔ kiya awu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ ŋɔ a ŋɔ le.&gt;&gt; I na mu kwuye kwɔngu ishekeyi, u vɔngɔ kiya awu e to wu mo a ka wa mogba wu.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwu Undu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Omatiyu 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Omaki 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Oluku 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu te a mbwa apula lɛɛbi ma-a, akwɛyi kwuwongu kaa iso iyi Ukpo li nyɔlɔma, Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ugbembi u wo mi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ogya uwu embyi umba iwuma ba e shi kɛlɛ mɔmɔ, akwɛyi o lo amegbere mɛmi mba, o lo ngwu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu amegbere, akwɛyi o yi ngwu mo o ka ngwa kɛlɛ mbaa kenzu unga Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Kwuye ngwu bɔkɔ a na embyi mbamba ma, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;I bo mo-o.&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ e so tayi, akwɛyi e le reshi mo akwɛyi a ta kwunyɔ ma.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O La Ɔzhizɔsi Kwɔku Mu Kamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Akwɛyi wa to keyi umba Azhu o nda Opayileti kwoya kaa lo shi mbo kapa kaa lo mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpa mba mu kwuwɛyi awu alɛ ma, kaa lo kala ɛnwu mba ma mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. O nda kwoya kwɔlɛ kwuwongu akwu ɔnu uwu ɛnwu iyi mo, umba ba o gyi te lo lu mba afyima mɔmɔ gbola kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo, moo kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo kwɔngu akwu kwu kɛrikɛri. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Akwɛyi asozha o ka o mu alɛ iyi onzu uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ o kpawu mu kwuwɛyi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi, mbala uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e shimo awu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi ba o du te e kpomo-o. Akwɛyi o mu wu alɛ ma fo. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Osozha uwufo ba a la Ɔzhizɔsi kwɔku mu kamba, akwɛyi ɛnzhi mbala embyi o wɔ kwudu. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />(Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ma ɛlɛ awu a na izɔgɔ, izɔgɔ wu akwu ongbulolo. Iso iyi e so le akwu ongbulolo, akwɛyi e so ɛlɛ kaa uŋɔ tete ka kwu idu fulo.) <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo te kaa iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo lɛɛbi li nyɔlɔma: &lt;&lt;Kwuku wu kwukpukpɛnyi te kwu muma mo,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />tabɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo ungufo kwu so tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu O yese onzu uwu bɔkɔ o la wu kwɔku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Pwu Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Omatiyu 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Omaki 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Oluku 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhɔsɛfu uwu Arimatiya a nda Opayileti ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi. Ɔzhɔsɛfu akwu u vɔngɔ kiya uwu Ɔzhizɔsi, wɛrɛrɛ moo a wiyi iyi umba Azhu. Mu inyama iyi Opayileti, e bo akwɛyi e to ukpɛzhi ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Ɔnikɔdimɔ onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka mba Ɔzhizɔsi mutu awu a zɛ mbala Ɔzhɔsɛfu. Ɔnikɔdimɔ a za la anyi umba bɔkɔ o wo mbo mu omari mbala aloyi, iyi bɔkɔ ɔlu yi i yi kyamate ekilo uwekpela tayi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Anzɔnu wepo mbɔlɛ o to ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi ma, akwɛyi o tɛ wu okpayi mɛnwu mbala otulare, mu okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ. O wo kyamate bɔkɔ ukwu uwɛdɔ uwu Azhu bɔkɔ o pwu ukpɛzhi. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Mɔgɔ uwu o kpa Ɔzhizɔsi mu kwuwɛyi awu, utu uwufo u yi mɔmɔ. Mu utu ɔnwu ogariwu uwopo e yi mɔmɔ, uwu bɔkɔ o ta onzu mɔmɔ dɛ mo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kwuwongwu akwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwuyimo iyi Azhu, ogariwu kwɔngu ba kwu yi kɛlɛ mɔmɔ, O ta Ɔzhizɔsi mɔmɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ogariwu Uwidɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Omatiyu 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Omaki 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Oluku 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Mu kwoto mu kwoto ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu kwonze, mu eyifumo, Omeri uwu a wɔ mu Omagadali a ka mbaa Ogariwu akwɛyi e du te o turu kwokyi mo-o mu kenzu unga ogariwu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Akwɛyi a renya a ka mba Ɔsamɔ Opita mbala u vɔngɔ kiya uwu fo, uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e pwu idɛnyi wu awu, a za wu te o to Ɔkwu ma mu ogariwu oo, kinzu ba ki yitu mɔgɔ uwu bɔkɔ oshi wu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Akwɛyi Opita mbala u vɔngɔ kiya uwufo o fulomo o ka mba ogariwu. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Umba wepepo mba o yi mu enya irima, u vɔngɔ kiya uwufo awu ba e to keyi la Opita akwɛyi a ka mu ogariwu keyi. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />E lemo akwɛyi e kpeyi mɛmi akwɛyi a ma okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ a ta mɛzhi mɔmɔ uwu ba e fyemo mɛmi mo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Akwɛyi Ɔsamɔ Opita, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu inyɔma mizhikembo, e bomo akwɛyi e fyemo mɛmi iyi ogariwu. A ma okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ mɔmɔ, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />i kyo okpayi uwu bɔkɔ o tɛ Ɔzhizɔsi mu reshi. Okpayi awu e kwumo a ta ikikɔ la okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Mu imbwama yi u vɔngɔ kiya uwu bɔkɔ e shi mo, uwu bɔkɔ a ka mu ogariwu keyi awu, uwu tete e fyemo mɛmi. A ma akwɛyi e kwu idu lu fulo. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Umba ba o zɔngɔma yi ma mo kpɔ iyi bɔkɔ iso iyi Ukpo i so te Ɔzhizɔsi ee yimo mu kwuvɔ mɛga awu).<verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya o gbama o ka ma mogba ,<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Omeri Uwu Omagadali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Omatiyu 28.9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Omaki 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Omeri ba a rima mu kwudu ungwu ogariwu mu oga ilomo. Tabɔkɔ e yi mu oga ilomo, e lemo kaa le yese mɛmi iyi ogariwu <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />akwɛyi a ma alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo wepo laa ɛriga iruwu, o ŋɔma mba bɔkɔ o shi ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi le, ukpɛnyi a ŋɔ mba reshi wu, akwɛyi uwufo ba a ŋɔ mba alɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />O yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Okokpayi, kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ ŋɔ lo oga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">A zɔ te, &lt;&lt;O to Ɔkwu mi ma o ka wu ma-a,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Imi ba mi yitu mba bɔkɔ o shi wu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Tabɔkɔ e so tayi, akwɛyi e gele eyi akwɛyi a ma Ɔzhizɔsi te a rima mɔmɔ, uwu ba a zɔngɔma wu ma te akwu Ɔzhizɔsi mo.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ uwu kwogba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ ŋɔ lo oga? Ŋɔ kagyi uwe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">A ma kyamate akwu onzu wu bɔ eyi mu utu uwu ogariwu ŋa akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, akwiyi gba uŋɔ gba ŋɔ to wu mo le de ba, zɔ mi mɔgɔ uwu ŋɔ shi wu, akwɛyi mi to wu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ya wu ma te, &lt;&lt;Omeri!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">E fulo biri e sele wu eyi akwɛyi a ta oga kpa mu kenzu unga Iburu te, &lt;&lt;Oraboni!&gt;&gt; (iyi bɔkɔ o lu yi te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya.&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Kwu pwa mi afyi mo, moo mi ka mba Ada mo bɛnɛ. So mba ɛmɛmbɛnɛ mi ka za mba te, &lt;Mi gba mi sheyimo mba Ada mi mbala ete yi, mba Ukpo mi mbala Ukpo yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Omeri uwu a wɔ mu Omagadali a ka mbaa wavɔvɔngɔ kiya laa eza ɛlɛ te: &lt;&lt;Imi mi ma Ɔkwu-a!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a ba mba eza i yi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e so wu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Omatiyu 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Omaki 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Oluku 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Mu onoyo uwu ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu kwonze, kwuye ungwu Wavɔngɔkiya o kpala ɛlu, akwɛyi o koko riku mo kwuwongu o wiyi iyi Azhu, Ɔzhizɔsi e bo akwɛyi a rima mekeka mba akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Idigbomo li yi mbala yi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e so ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a zɔ mba ewo wu mbala kamba wu. Wa vɔngɔ kiya o nyɔlɔma la ɔnyɛ tabɔkɔ o ma Ɔkwu.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a zɔ kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Idigbomo li yi mbala yi! Kyamate bɔkɔ Ada a lɔ mi, ta yi gba mi ye yi mu ilɔma le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Akwɛyi a fya mba ɛnyɔ a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;La lu na Kwundu uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Akwiyi gba lu gbala ingbomo iyi onzu uwunawuna lu kpa wu, o gba yi o kpa mba; akwiyi gba lu gba yi lu kpa mba mo, o gba yi o kpa mba mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Otoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Akwɛyi Otoma (iyi bɔkɔ o lu yi te apiri), onzu ukpɛnyi mekeka iyi wewo la wepo mbamba, e yi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e bo le mo. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya umba bɔkɔ o shimo awu o za wu te &lt;&lt;Ki ma Ɔkwu a!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Uwu ba a za mba te, &lt;&lt;akwiyi gba mi ma kɛzɔ unga iba iyi bɔkɔ o bɔ wu yi mu kwuwo akwɛyi mi lo ɛfyi mi mɔgɔ uwu iba ɛnyi, kaa la mi lo ɛfyi mi mu kamba wu mo, Imi mi kwu idu lu fulo ma yi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Mizhikembo iyi osati ukpɛnyi Wavɔngɔkiya o gba o ŋɔ mu ugu kpɔ, Otoma ba e yi mbala mba. Riku ba ri lomo, Ɔzhizɔsi e bo akwɛyi a rima mekeka mba akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Idigbomo li yi mbala yi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Otoma tee, &lt;&lt;Lo ɛfyi ŋɔ munɛ; yese ewo mi. Nda kwuwo ŋɔ shaa ka lo ngwu mu kamba mi. Lafya la kambu irimo ka kwu idu lu fulo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Akwɛyi Otoma a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu mi mbala Ukpo mi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Otoma te, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu ŋɔ ma mi-a le, gba ŋɔ kwu idu lu fulo le? Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o ma mi mo ba o kwu idu lu fulo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiya Ingyi Ki Shi Bɔkɔ O Ka Kwokpo Kwɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Ɔzhizɔsi e wo apula amɛ gyɔɔ meyi iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu, iyi bɔkɔ o ka yi ma mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ mo. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ɛlɛ ba o ka yi ma ka la lu kwu idu lu fulo te Ɔzhizɔsi akwu Okrasi, Umɛ uwu Ukpo, akwiyi gba lu kwu idu lu fulo ma wu lu yi kwunyɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu Werewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Mizhikembo ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ ɛnwu wu ma kpɔ laa Wavɔngɔkiya, mu kwuko ungwu risu ingyi Otaberiya. Te gba i wo le: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Ɔsamɔ Opita, Otoma (iyi bɔkɔ o lu yi te apiri), Ɔnataniyɛ uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu Okena mu Ogalili, umɛ uwu Ɔzɛbɛdi, mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wepo umbafo o yi mbala esu. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Ɔsamɔ Opita e so mbo te &lt;&lt;Imi mi sheyimo mbaa emu iyimo,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ki rimo, mbala ŋa.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o kama mu kwudu o fyemo mu kwoda, mutu kwɔngu ba o yi kiya kinyinyi te mo. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Mu eyifumo, Ɔzhizɔsi a rimu kenzu unga risu, Wavɔngɔkiya ba o zɔngɔma ma te akwu Ɔzhizɔsi mo.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />A ya mba ma akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛza mi, lu yi emu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">O gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ayi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu to iya yi mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu kwoda yi de luu fya.&gt;&gt; Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o wo tayi, akwɛyi o do eya ɛnyi ipyipyimo mo kwuwongu o yi emu gyɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Akwɛyi u vɔngɔ kiya uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e pwu idɛnyi wu awu a za la Opita te, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ akwu Ɔkwu!&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ Opita a pwa te, &lt;&lt;Akwu Ɔkwu awu,&gt;&gt; Mu kwotota kwɔngu a gba e lo ɔmu wu mɛnwu (moo a lu wu ma kpeke) akwɛyi e yi mo a la mu embyi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya umba bɔkɔ o shimo awu o mbwalu wu mu kwoda, o yi mu iya ipyipyimo inyi ba inyɔlɔma la emu, moo o ndama mbala ɛzhi mo, iyi kyamate ata oderi tayi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o kalama, o ma ɔyi tabɔkɔ u yi mu izɛma mɔmɔ laa emu, mbala eburedi iyifo.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu bo la emu umbafo umba bɔkɔ lu yi kekelele awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Ɔsamɔ Opita a ya kadu akwɛyi e pyipyi iya e bo yi mu kenzu unga risu. Emu umbakwu o nyɔlɔma duduu, oderi la uwo ɛkpɛlɔ la ɛla, tetete bɔkɔ o yi gyɔɔ awu eya itarama mo. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu bo ka la ki ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi kwoto,&gt;&gt; Onzu ukpukpɛnyi te meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya ba e yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ kwu uwe mo?&gt;&gt; Moo o yitu te akwu Ɔkwu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Ɔzhizɔsi e bo, e to oburedi akwɛyi e shi mbo, akwɛyi e wo tayi tete mɔgɔ uwu emu. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ɛlɛ akwu ungwola bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ ɛnwu wu ma laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ e yimo mu lukwu.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Opita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o mbwa kiya irimo, Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Ɔsamɔ Opita te, &lt;&lt;Ɔsamɔ umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔnu, uŋɔ ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi mi ika ɛlɛ ma iyesheshi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">A zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ee, Ɔkwu&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ yitu tee mi pwu idɛnyi ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Shi ilɔ mi kiya ingyirimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />A kwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba e yo wu kwuyo ngwopo kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɔsamɔ umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔnu, ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi mi ngboro?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">A gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ee, Ɔkwu, ŋɔ yitu te mi pwu idɛnyi ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt; Bɔ ilɔ mi eyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Ungwola a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ɔsamɔ umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔnu, ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi mi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Ubu uwu Opita e fomo kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu kwuyo ungwola te, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi mi?&gt;&gt; A zɔ te Ɔkwu ŋɔ yitu iyi kiya lɛɛbi; ŋɔ yitu te mi pwu idɛnyi ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Shi ilɔ mi kiya ingyirimo. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Mi so yi ongbulolo, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu kwu alugbaga awu lu lo apula mɛnwu mafyi yi akwɛyi lu re mɔgɔ uwu bɔkɔ lu gyi; kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu kwu enzumbakɔ ba lu nda ewo ye shaa, akwɛyi onzawa gba e lo yi apula mɛnwu le akwɛyi e re ye mu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ lu gyi te la lu so mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Ɔzhizɔsi e so ɛlɛ kaa li zɔ lukwu undu bɔkɔ Opita e bo kpo kaa le shi Ukpo inzumbɛku. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Mbwalu mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala U vɔngɔ Kiya Uwufo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Opita e fulo biri akwɛyi a ma u vɔngɔ kiya uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e pwu idɛnyi wu awu te eye mbo mu imbwalu ma. (Ele akwu uwu bɔkɔ a wɛlɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o yi mu kiya ingyirimo ingyi onoyo awu akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, uwe bɔkɔ e to ŋɔ a yama?&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Tabɔkɔ Opita a ma uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e pwu idɛnyi wu awu, e yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, ele kɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba mi gyi te la ŋɔ nzhii ba mi gbama kɔ, i ta ŋa te? Uŋɔ mbwalu mi byi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ eza i kpashaa mekeka iyi ɛmɛnɛ te u vɔngɔ kiya uwu Ɔzhizɔsi ele ee kpomo mo. Ɔzhizɔsi ba e so te e kpomo mo mo; uwu de e so te, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba e yi kwunyɔ nzhii ba mi gba kɔ, i ta ŋa te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />U vɔngɔ kiya ele gba akwu u uzɔgɔ uwu apula ɛlɛ le akwɛyi a ka yi ma e shi mɛzhi. Ki yitu te izɔgɔ wu akwu ongbulolo.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbwama Iyi Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Ɔzhizɔsi e wo apula iyi fo gyɔɔ tete. Gba lo zɔ te apula lɛɛbi lo ka yi ma shi mɛzhi kɛnyikɛnyi, Mi ma te kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi kwu yi ugu uwu bɔkɔ oo fu ekpo iyi bɔkɔ o bo ka le mo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>